              text: "1. **User Privacy (PII Isolation)**: `/users/{userId}` stores email and avatar configuration; only `request.auth.uid == userId` may read or write it. Collection listing is forbidden."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
