              text: "3. **Subcollection Master Gate**: Every document in `artworks`, `members`, and `presence` must belong to an existing parent `/museums/{museumId}` and carry matching `museumId` and `ownerId`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
