  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Verification Process**\n\nI\'m starting the first verification round using headless Chromium via `playwright-cli`. My focus is on the Home Avatar Studio at the desktop resolution 1440x900. I\'ll capture a screenshot of the first paint, inspect the console, and snapshot the DOM. The files will be saved in `.playwright-cli/r1-home-desktop.png`.\n\n\n**Expanding Verification Scope**\n\nI\'m now expanding the verification process to include the Woman Model. I\'ll update the name, confirm the Avatar Studio updates, and proceed to click \"Enter 3D Museum.\" I will wait for the WebGL and textures to load before capturing `.playwright-cli/r1-museum-desktop.png`. I\'ll also verify forward movement with \"W\", explore the Date-Sorted Catalog, and upload new artwork to expand the museum, and verify the Share Access modal, all at 1440x900 desktop resolution.\n\n\n"
