    thinking: "**Verifying Test Harness**\n\nI\'m now implementing a comprehensive verification script using `playwright-cli`, leveraging the identified labels and data attributes. I recall that I don\'t need the `--headed` flag, as headless Chromium works perfectly well with the `playwright-cli` approach I\'m taking. The goal is to ensure all elements function as designed.\n\n\n"
