  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Prioritizing Targeted Fixes**\n\nI\'m focused on parallel implementation of high-impact fixes. Currently, I\'m starting in `src/three/avatarBuilder.ts` to add `maxLegSwing:`. My next steps are applying these same fixes, in parallel, to `src/components/Museum3DView.tsx` and `src/App.tsx`.\n\n\n**Refining Avatar Geometry**\n\nI\'m currently refining avatar geometry. I\'ve adjusted leg swing parameters in `AvatarRig` and added default values. I\'ve also addressed woman\'s leg geometry when wearing specific outfits. I\'m focusing on ensuring smooth transitions and preventing clipping. Additionally, I\'m working on adjusting hair geometry for both male and female avatars.\n\n\n**Adjusting Geometry and Refinements**\n\nI\'m focused on fine-tuning avatar and museum details. I\'ve adjusted head geometry parameters for natural hair volume from different viewing angles, and refined the shoulder silhouette and nameplate sprite size. In the museum view, I\'ve added a pause prop and I\'m currently working to calibrate the gallery lighting and atmospheric fog.\n\n\n"
