  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting Visuals Critically**\n\nWow, I\'m really pleased with the latest review of those screenshots! The 3D model of the woman in `r2b-home-mobile.png` is looking fantastic now. Her forehead is clear, the glasses are sharp, and her hair is perfectly sleek. Such a relief we did a detailed inspection of each one.\n\n\n**Reviewing Detail, Refining**\n\nI\'m incredibly happy with the `r2b-catalog-desktop.png` image\342\200\224it\'s truly museum-quality! The typography and chronological headers are superb, and the sorting functions are perfectly operational. I\'m moving on to rigorously scrutinizing `r2b-home-desktop.png` now. Also, I\'m focusing on `r2b-museum-desktop.png`, where I found a significant issue! The dark background was a major problem, and I am zeroing in on a rendering issue in `Museum3DView.tsx`.\n\n\n"
