  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Fixing the Bug**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the issue! It seems our script clicked `manBtn` and `submit` simultaneously within a single JavaScript event loop tick, prior to React\'s `setGender(\'man\')` flush. The code within `AccessModal` itself is actually clean, the problem lies in the timing. Now, the fix!\n\n\n"
