n: Why is `gl.readPixels` yielding zeros after `renderer.render(scene, camera)` completes? I\'ve eliminated some possibilities, like a non-null render target or a post-render size reset. It *shouldn\'t* be happening! The only potential culprits seem to be an early return, or the render never being called. I\'m focusing on line 378 of `Museum3DView.tsx` and line 435 of `App.tsx` now. The `catalogOpen`, `uploadOpen`, `accessOpen`, and `inspectState` need scrutiny for *initial* values.\n\n\n"
