  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Bug\'s Impact**\n\nI\'ve just pinpointed a critical bug in `App.tsx`! Line 435, specifically `Boolean(inspectState)`, was the culprit. Because `inspectState` was initialized as `{ artwork: null, slotIndex: 0 }`, it always evaluated to `true`. This single oversight cascaded into a multitude of issues within the Museum. I\'m now exploring the downstream effects.\n\n\n**Unveiling Downstream Effects**\n\nI\'ve traced the bug\'s fallout to the `3DView` component. It was receiving `isPaused={true}` constantly. This prevented the avatar from walking, disabled camera movement, and froze companion avatars. The fix is to modify `App.tsx` and change `isPaused` condition. Also, I\'m integrating this with cloud storage sync status visibility on the upload modal.\n\n\n**Implementing Firebase Cloud Sync**\n\nI\'m now integrating Google Sign-In with Firebase for permanent data storage. For guest users, I\'ll use `localStorage`, but I\'m adding a robust error handling mechanism. If `localStorage.setItem` fails due to `QuotaExceededError`, a clear toast message will alert the user.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Enhancing Museum Navigation**\n\nI\'m upgrading the keyboard walking and navigation within `Museum3DView.tsx`. I\'ve added `tabIndex={0}` to the root container and implemented auto-focus to ensure keyboard inputs are correctly routed to the 3D canvas. Also, I\'m calling `e.preventDefault()` on navigation keys such as `ArrowUp`, `ArrowDown`, `ArrowLeft`, `ArrowRight`, `Space` to prevent browser hijacks. I\'m also ensuring all keys are cleared on `window` blur or `isPaused` transition.\n\n\n**Refining Keyboard Navigation**\n\nI\'ve just added super intuitive full-museum keyboard controls that function perfectly with keyboard alone, or keyboard and mouse. I\'ve mapped WASD and arrow keys for forward, backward, and strafe movements. Left/Right arrows and Q/E smoothly turn the camera. Shift enables a faster walk speed, and both `e.code` and `e.key.toLowerCase()` are supported. There\'s also smooth automatic sliding when the user walks into a bench!\n\n\n**Improving Museum Mobility**\n\nNow, I\'m working on resolving user deadlocks against benches by adding automatic sliding along the nearest open aisle. This ensures smooth movement and allows users to traverse museum corridors easily. I\'m exposing `data-player-x` and `data-player-z` on the root node for Playwright verification of movement. Finally, I\'ve updated the bottom dock hint to `WASD / \342\206\221\342\206\223 Walk \302\267 \342\206\220\342\206\222 / Q E Turn \302\267 Drag Look \302\267 Shift Fast`.\n\nAlso, I\'m upgrading `UploadArtworkModal.tsx`. I\'m going to accept an `isCloudSynced` prop to display clear storage information. If the user is signed in, the message will be `\"Cloud Storage \302\267 Saved to Firebase Firestore (museums/{id}/artworks) and synced across devices.\"` If a guest, the message will be: `\"Local Browser Storage \302\267 Saved on this device. Sign in with Google on the Home page to save permanently to Firebase Firestore.\"`\n\n\n"
    message_id: "TdcBa5e8LJToz7IPnvT5wAU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3697158258554466006"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Fix always-true isPaused bug (inspectState.artwork), add localStorage quota warning, and pass cloud storage status to UploadArtworkModal\", \"Instruction\":\"Fix Boolean(inspectState.artwork) for Museum3DView isPaused, surface localStorage quota errors, and pass isCloudSynced to UploadArtworkModal in src/App.tsx\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":139, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (user) return;\\n    try {\\n      window.localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_MUSEUM_KEY, JSON.stringify(guestMuseum));\\n      window.localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_ARTWORKS_KEY, JSON.stringify(guestArtworks));\\n      window.localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_MEMBERS_KEY, JSON.stringify(guestMembers));\\n    } catch {\\n      showToast(\'Browser local storage is full. Sign in with Google to save images to Firebase Cloud.\');\\n    }\\n  }, [user, guestMuseum, guestArtworks, guestMembers, showToast]);\", \"StartLine\":129, \"TargetContent\":\"  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (user) return;\\n    try {\\n      window.localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_MUSEUM_KEY, JSON.stringify(guestMuseum));\\n      window.localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_ARTWORKS_KEY, JSON.stringify(guestArtworks));\\n      window.localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_MEMBERS_KEY, JSON.stringify(guestMembers));\\n    } catch {\\n      // Ignore storage quota issues\\n    }\\n  }, [user, guestMuseum, guestArtworks, guestMembers]);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":472, \"ReplacementContent\":\"          onChangeWallTheme={handleChangeWallTheme}\\n          onPositionBroadcast={handlePositionBroadcast}\\n          isPaused={catalogOpen || uploadOpen || accessOpen || Boolean(inspectState.artwork)}\\n        />\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Date-Sorted Complete Archival Catalog Drawer */}\\n      <CatalogDrawer\\n        open={catalogOpen}\\n        onClose={() => setCatalogOpen(false)}\\n        artworks={artworks}\\n        canCurate={canCurate}\\n        onWalkToArtwork={\\n          view === \'museum\'\\n            ? (id) => setTeleportTargetId(id)\\n            : (id) => {\\n                setView(\'museum\');\\n                setTeleportTargetId(id);\\n              }\\n        }\\n        onInspectArtwork={(artwork, slotIndex) =>\\n          setInspectState({ artwork, slotIndex })\\n        }\\n        onDeleteArtwork={handleDeleteArtwork}\\n        onOpenUpload={() => {\\n          setCatalogOpen(false);\\n          setUploadOpen(true);\\n        }}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Upload / Hang New Artwork Modal */}\\n      <UploadArtworkModal\\n        open={uploadOpen}\\n        onClose={() => setUploadOpen(false)}\\n        currentArtworkCount={artworks.length}\\n        defaultArtist={avatar.displayName}\\n        isCloudSynced={Boolean(user && cloudMuseums.length > 0)}\\n        onSubmitArtwork={handleAddArtwork}\\n      />\", \"StartLine\":432, \"TargetContent\":\"          onChangeWallTheme={handleChangeWallTheme}\\n          onPositionBroadcast={handlePositionBroadcast}\\n          isPaused={catalogOpen || uploadOpen || accessOpen || Boolean(inspectState)}\\n        />\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Date-Sorted Complete Archival Catalog Drawer */}\\n      <CatalogDrawer\\n        open={catalogOpen}\\n        onClose={() => setCatalogOpen(false)}\\n        artworks={artworks}\\n        canCurate={canCurate}\\n        onWalkToArtwork={\\n          view === \'museum\'\\n            ? (id) => setTeleportTargetId(id)\\n            : (id) => {\\n                setView(\'museum\');\\n                setTeleportTargetId(id);\\n              }\\n        }\\n        onInspectArtwork={(artwork, slotIndex) =>\\n          setInspectState({ artwork, slotIndex })\\n        }\\n        onDeleteArtwork={handleDeleteArtwork}\\n        onOpenUpload={() => {\\n          setCatalogOpen(false);\\n          setUploadOpen(true);\\n        }}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Upload / Hang New Artwork Modal */}\\n      <UploadArtworkModal\\n        open={uploadOpen}\\n        onClose={() => setUploadOpen(false)}\\n        currentArtworkCount={artworks.length}\\n        defaultArtist={avatar.displayName}\\n        onSubmitArtwork={handleAddArtwork}\\n      />\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Fixing Museum3DView pause condition and upload sync status\", \"toolSummary\":\"Fix pause bug and storage info in App.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\361*\n\356*\001i\024}\023Z\\\021\265\246)L\264\034<2\327\350gNu1\334\035\227CL\024\r_f\314\200y\372\220\033\2706R6\230\237C\261\357\036#\2463\tP\266\277\032 \020\"\3144x\277\370{\341\210\323\026\206\262;}{\212L\372\274VDl~\324\253\300#\003\352oD4?\265x\245\r1s~Cp\363\206% 3l\244[\331\"9\025D\371\320gH\205B\312\330n\211\266\246\316\177\372\242b_\324\260R\025\277n\001\202\322OO\254\022\243\226\r\322R\024\036\342B\v\264d\301 \205xHY\253z\272\211h\233\v_\257U=\250\241n\rh\212N9\313\233\221\371.\324F\023\304\327\362U+|v\327\357\301`\\BqGi\3469c%\004-\321\377W&\266\301\v-@\275(\301\337\024)\303\r\036\207\314\b&\203\337\3347\200G\313d\274=\333\334\273\261\347C\357\363\225\265|\336\215\340\n+{\324z\006\251\006\3305TB)uE\237\363\316\233\021/\351\311*Y\025\035\361j\215;\350AG`w6\311\202i\260\323\n\236c\325a\306\a%\177MR\326\373\201\'Z\266\354d-\253\255O\312\327\346~g\327\317w\262\031~\226\372z\301TG\300u\301\216\253\230\345<\364\374\264\3152\'\371f\020\261\326b\351<\245\250\246\314\216\266Z\200\233;\324\177{\371\230\222\004\260~<+\21438\210\332\020\231\253\326\v\004x\373\372\225\365\270\344\\\264\203/u1\376\373\353I\f\256\227\263{&\313\325\377)\225\364X\254\316\020\322@D\372\a%D\270\266=:\312\262\371w{\246\026\267\357\030\332%E>\vN\374m\211\303G`\256\222\274{\236\343\223\204\025])P\2615(\fu^^rKtNj\270\361`\201\3377\306\177?Q\236Y%\364F\302\220\t9\332g\262\006M\306\224\377wc\331SJ\na\323|XCE\265i Q\317\370\252\035gL\022\rb\362\363\231\254?\f\201\301.Fi\250\004\003{s\252\037z6\030\306\305;N\367\270[\005\036!\266\250k\022\217+\372\255<\226\332\303\201\260\371\320\b\370\037\bE\003:9\331\332\372\231\021-q8{m\306\311\005I\354\363\017&\030\303\317\362n\206nh*\313y\303#\343\2057m)\341(\235O\361\202\200\350\275X(\223I,\316\372>@\356\026\246pD$\271\t\020t\373\362\\\215[T\313P\326\027=ei\261\003\246\314\017\304\237|\314\346\330Sd\303\r\271\352\216\322\340\336\253\361`\277\330\253R<\037\226\235g;HC\234\256\251 zs\210\201\363\247uw\342,(\323\211\237\231F\t\