  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Keyboard Focus**\n\nI need to remember the `window.addEventListener(\'blur\', clearAllKeys)` event. A critical realization is that `clearAllKeys` should *only* clear held keys when `blur` fires. It is important to not cancel the `frameId` or permanently stop the animation loop if the application is not paused. What a crucial refinement, just before moving on! Let\'s split `clearAllKeys` further!\n\n\n"
