  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Project Launch**\n\nI\'m pleased to report a clean initial build! The next step involves restarting the development server (`restart_dev_server`) to deploy the multi-room museum code. Following that, I intend to conduct comprehensive Playwright end-to-end verification, encompassing both visual and interactive tests. The initial focus will be on the home aspect.\n\n\n**Confirming Museum Transition**\n\nI\'ve got a new milestone: Studio renders with updated metrics, no console errors. I\'ve entered the 3D museum via `?autostart=1` and inspected Room I (Grand Rotunda), with the central porcelain amphora and artworks. Next, I added four artworks. I\'m verifying the `data-rooms` attribute updated from `1` to `2`. Finally, I walked North to confirm the closed connecting door blocks passage, and the prompt appears.\n\n\n"
