  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Admiring the Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m utterly captivated by `02_closed_door_signboard.png`! The Celadon Porcelain Amphora, adorned with gilded bronze handles and delicate white/blush magnolias, is strikingly sculptural and editorial. The gilded signboard \"ROOM II \302\267 Botanical Atrium\" completes the visual narrative beautifully.\n\n\n**Refining Interactivity Focus**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on interactivity improvements. The \"Press [F] or Click Door \302\267 Click Sign to Rename\" text is perfectly clear! I\'m impressed by the museum-quality presentation of the framed courtyard and alpine paintings. Also, the HUD placard\'s details are coming together. Furthermore, I\'ve identified that we need to address a small interaction radius issue concerning Julian\'s approach to the door, which I\'ll resolve by tweaking the interact radius and Playwright test.\n\n\n**Verifying Key Interactions**\n\nI\'ve just validated core interactions, confirming the player can now reliably open the door and rename the room. I\'ve tested standing at the door, pressing F, and moving into the room. I\'ve also addressed the `page.screenshot` timeout issue by adjusting the software-GL pause to 100ms. I also skip the redundant render in `toggleDoorById` now. The interact radius is now set to 5.2. Playwright should pass now!\n\n\n"
    message_id: "AeQBa7CCAqaU6dkPmfLq0Ac"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12539140468148573035"
