    thinking: "**Confirming Compilation & Linting**\n\nI\'m pleased to report both `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` commands have completed successfully, with no errors detected. Next, I\'m setting up a quick Playwright test to verify functionality. This test will teleport to Artwork #9 in Room II via the Date Catalog, rename Room II to \"Botanical Sanctuary,\" and capture a screenshot.\n\n\n"
