  planner_response {
    response: "All requested fixes and multi-room 3D museum upgrades are complete and verified:\n\n### 1. Strict Per-User Database Isolation & Sign-Out Bug Fix\n- **Account-Only Private Cloud Data**: Signed-in users now read and write strictly to their own private Firebase Firestore museum (`museums/museum_{uid}/artworks/...`) and never fall back to or write into shared browser `localStorage` guest state.\n- **Private by Default**: Newly created user museums start empty and private (`isOpenByCode: false`) so no other signed-in account can see your images unless you explicitly grant them access by email or enable an access code.\n- **Clean Sign-Out Reset**: Signing out immediately clears all authenticated cloud artworks, members, room names, and cached local preview data so signed-in uploads never remain visible after sign-out or leak across accounts.\n\n### 2. Multi-Room Architecture (8 Walls per Room)\n- **Automatic New Rooms**: Every room holds **8 artwork walls** (3 West, 3 East, and 2 North-flanking walls beside the doorway). Once a room reaches 8 artworks, uploading the 9th artwork automatically constructs **Room II** (with 8 more walls), the 17th constructs **Room III**, and so on.\n- **Distinct Room Shapes & Curated 3D Flower Vases**: Rooms cycle through 4 unique architectural designs, skylights, floor inlays, and procedural 3D floral centerpieces:\n  1. **Room I \342\200\224 Grand Rotunda**: Octagonal chamfered corners, circular dome oculus, and a **Celadon Porcelain Amphora with White & Blush Magnolias**.\n  2. **Room II \342\200\224 Botanical Atrium**: Conservatory glass roof trusses, corner potted olive trees, and a **Sculpted Terracotta Urn with Olive Branches & Golden Pampas Plumes**.\n  3. **Room III \342\200\224 Imperial Salon**: Walnut wainscoting, coffered ceiling lantern, corner ferns, and a **Cobalt & Gold Chinoiserie Baluster Vase with Peonies**.\n  4. **Room IV \342\200\224 Sculpture Pavilion**: Modernist oak light fins, floating ceiling baffles, and a **Brushed Bronze Vessel with White Orchids & Eucalyptus**.\n\n### 3. Interactive Double Doors & Keyboard Controls\n- **Solid Doors Between Rooms**: Each new room connects through a hinged walnut-and-brass double door that physically blocks passage when closed and swings open smoothly when triggered.\n- **Keyboard & Click Controls**: Walk up to any connecting door and press **`F`** or **`Space`** (or click the door / on-screen prompt) to open or close it and walk into the next room. Using **Walk To Wall** from the date-sorted catalog automatically opens connecting doors along the way.\n\n### 4. Clickable Editable Room Name Signboards Above Every Door\n- **3D Doorway Signboards**: Every room doorway features a gilded dark-walnut **Room Name Signboard** mounted above the frame.\n- **Click to Rename**: Click any signboard above a door (or the pencil icon in the top-left room placard) to rename that room. Custom room names update the 3D signboard texture immediately and persist to your personal Firestore museum (`roomNames`).\n\n> **Security Note**: The updated `firestore.rules` (including owner-only `roomNames` updates and strict private museum isolation) have been linted and deployed. Please review `firestore.rules` before sharing your app broadly to ensure the access rules match your preferences."
