g baffles, and a **Brushed Bronze Vessel with White Orchids & Eucalyptus**.\n\n### 3. Interactive Double Doors & Keyboard Controls\n- **Solid Doors Between Rooms**: Each new room connects through a hinged walnut-and-brass double door that physically blocks passage when closed and swings open smoothly when triggered.\n- **Keyboard & Click Controls**: Walk up to any connecting door and press **`F`** or **`Space`** (or click the door / on-screen prompt) to open or close it and walk into the next room. Using **Walk To Wall** from the date-sorted catalog automatically opens connecting doors along the way.\n\n### 4. Clickable Editable Room Name Signboards Above Every Door\n- **3D Doorway Signboards**: Every room doorway features a gilded dark-walnut **Room Name Signboard** mounted above the frame.\n- **Click to Rename**: Click any signboard above a door (or the pencil icon in the top-left room placard) to rename that room. Custom room names update the 3D signboard texture immediately and persist to your personal Firestore museum (`roomNames`).\n\n> **Security Note**: The updated `firestore.rules` (including owner-only `roomNames` updates and strict private museum isolation) have been linted and deployed. Please review `firestore.rules` before sharing your app broadly to ensure the access rules match your preferences."
