xt to the room title in the top-left HUD) to rename that room. Custom room names save directly to your Firebase museum when signed in.\n\n5. **Distinct Room Shapes & Curated Floral Vase Centerpieces**\n   - Each room cycles through 4 unique architectural designs and sculptural 3D centerpieces:\n     - **Grand Rotunda** \342\200\224 chamfered octagonal corner piers, circular domed oculus skylight, brass floor medallion, and a **Celadon Porcelain Amphora with White Magnolias**.\n     - **Botanical Atrium** \342\200\224 glass conservatory roof trusses, corner potted olive trees, and a **Terracotta Urn with Olive Branches & Golden Pampas**.\n     - **Imperial Salon** \342\200\224 dark walnut wainscoting, coffered lantern ceiling, and a **Cobalt & Gold Chinoiserie Vase with Crimson & Blush Peonies**.\n     - **Sculpture Pavilion** \342\200\224 architectural oak light fins, linear twin skylights, and a **Brushed Bronze Vessel with White Orchids & Eucalyptus**.\n\n> **Security Note:** The updated Firestore security rules (including per-user privacy and custom room-name updates) have been linted and deployed. Please review `firestore.rules` before sharing your museum publicly with broader audiences."
