  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Inviter System**\n\nI\'ve successfully configured the OAuth system. My current focus is designing and building a comprehensive Museum Email Invitation & Direct Link Entry System. This system must fully adhere to every guideline detailed in `workspace-integration/SKILL.md`, `firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`, and also the `ultra` documentation, to guarantee it is robust.\n\n\n**Implementing OAuth Details**\n\nI\'ve added the required Gmail scope and implemented in-memory OAuth token management, as per the specifications. Specifically, I\'ve added `WORKSPACE_SCOPES` and added scope to the provider. I\'ve also implemented `signInWithGoogle()`, `getGmailAccessToken()`, `clearGmailAccessToken()`, and `requestGmailPermission()` functions to handle token caching, retrieval, and permission requests, adhering to the security guidelines by not storing the access token in local or session storage.\n\n\n**Refining Link Generation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on invite link architecture, ensuring seamless museum entry for recipients. My `buildMuseumInviteUrl` function is using `window.location.origin` for the base URL, or `VITE_APP_URL` as a fallback, and I\'m carefully encoding query parameters like museum ID and access code to guarantee safety. I\'m also thinking through how the invite link is handled on mount in `App.tsx`!\n\n\n**Defining Invite Scenarios**\n\nI\'m now detailing scenarios for invite link handling based on user sign-in status. I\'m focusing on parsing invite parameters like `invite`, `code`, `museum`, and `host` from `window.location.search`. I will store `pendingInvite` state with necessary details. I\'m working on two key cases: first, a \"Private Invitation Welcome Banner\" for non-signed-in users, and second, automatic museum resolution for signed-in users using `fetchInvitedMuseum`.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "5UkCa7CrAeasmtkPgJaE8Q4"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5147412987324774026"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { initializeApp } from \'firebase/app\';\\nimport { getAuth, GoogleAuthProvider, onAuthStateChanged, signInWithPopup, type User } from \'firebase/auth\';\\nimport { doc, getDocFromServer, getFirestore } from \'firebase/firestore\';\\nimport firebaseConfig from \'../firebase-applet-config.json\';\\n\\nexport const WORKSPACE_SCOPES = [\\n  \'https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.send\',\\n] as const;\\n\\nconst app = initializeApp(firebaseConfig);\\nexport const db = getFirestore(app, firebaseConfig.firestoreDatabaseId);\\nexport const auth = getAuth(app);\\n\\nexport const googleProvider = new GoogleAuthProvider();\\nfor (const scope of WORKSPACE_SCOPES) {\\n  googleProvider.addScope(scope);\\n}\\ngoogleProvider.setCustomParameters({ prompt: \'select_account\' });\\n\\n// Strict in-memory cache for Google Workspace OAuth access token (never stored in localStorage/sessionStorage)\\nlet cachedGmailAccessToken: string | null = null;\\n\\nonAuthStateChanged(auth, (user) => {\\n  if (!user) {\\n    cachedGmailAccessToken = null;\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nexport function getGmailAccessToken(): string | null {\\n  return cachedGmailAccessToken;\\n}\\n\\nexport function clearGmailAccessToken(): void {\\n  cachedGmailAccessToken = null;\\n}\\n\\nexport async function signInWithGoogleWorkspace(): Promise<{\\n  user: User;\\n  accessToken: string | null;\\n}> {\\n  const result = await signInWithPopup(auth, googleProvider);\\n  const credential = GoogleAuthProvider.credentialFromResult(result);\\n  cachedGmailAccessToken = credential?.accessToken ?? null;\\n  return {\\n    user: result.user,\\n    accessToken: cachedGmailAccessToken,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport async function requestGmailSendToken(): Promise<string> {\\n  if (cachedGmailAccessToken) {\\n    return cachedGmailAccessToken;\\n  }\\n  const { accessToken } = await signInWithGoogleWorkspace();\\n  if (!accessToken) {\\n    throw new Error(\\n      \'Gmail sending permission was not granted. Please sign in with Google and allow Gmail access to send invitation emails.\'\\n    );\\n  }\\n  return accessToken;\\n}\\n\\nexport enum OperationType {\\n  CREATE = \'create\',\\n  UPDATE = \'update\',\\n  DELETE = \'delete\',\\n  LIST = \'list\',\\n  GET = \'get\',\\n  WRITE = \'write\',\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FirestoreErrorInfo {\\n  error: string;\\n  operationType: OperationType;\\n  path: string | null;\\n  authInfo: {\\n    userId?: string | null;\\n    email?: string | null;\\n    emailVerified?: boolean | null;\\n    isAnonymous?: boolean | null;\\n    tenantId?: string | null;\\n    providerInfo?: {\\n      providerId?: string | null;\\n      email?: string | null;\\n    }[];\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function handleFirestoreError(\\n  error: unknown,\\n  operationType: OperationType,\\n  path: string | null\\n): never {\\n  const errInfo: FirestoreErrorInfo = {\\n    error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error),\\n    authInfo: {\\n      userId: auth.currentUser?.uid,\\n      email: auth.currentUser?.email,\\n      emailVerified: auth.currentUser?.emailVerified,\\n      isAnonymous: auth.currentUser?.isAnonymous,\\n      tenantId: auth.currentUser?.tenantId,\\n      providerInfo:\\n        auth.currentUser?.providerData?.map((provider) => ({\\n          providerId: provider.providerId,\\n          email: provider.email,\\n        })) || [],\\n    },\\n    operationType,\\n    path,\\n  };\\n  console.error(\'Firestore Error:\', JSON.stringify(errInfo));\\n  throw new Error(JSON.stringify(errInfo));\\n}\\n\\nasync function testConnection() {\\n  try {\\n    await getDocFromServer(doc(db, \'test\', \'connection\'));\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    if (error instanceof Error && error.message.includes(\'the client is offline\')) {\\n      console.error(\'Please check your Firebase configuration.\');\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nvoid testConnection();\\n\", \"Description\":\"Configure Gmail send Workspace scope on existing Firebase GoogleAuthProvider with strict in-memory token caching\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/firebase.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding Gmail Workspace scope and in-memory token cache to firebase.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update src/firebase.ts for Gmail OAuth\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\320P\n\315P\001i\024}\023\241V\357\237!\226\366\243g7\247%\231qOd\212\223\344\247\351\307\206\300\200C\205y\341\310\365\372\266\005F\032\227\311r\346Mf\201\252\037\357y\212\222\034\032\375G\341\336\352\366S\304\274\347\212\031\307\201\202\301\200\352\347\016s\345\\\247\'\274\357\227\252c\204M\325BN\333\263\257\377*J\316\335\304G\367s\202V>\370\310\365U\210\305\b\365\247\204\356g\036\366\262s\315_w\274\277H\313\026)L\001\021\3307\017#GJ{\022\220\000|\234\204b\320M\360\357\020v\027\366\265\243\277&Z\317\224+\261\206Dj%ZZ}\'\021\025\232\a8\031\272\362\263\030\226\205\363q\270\324\313\206h\322\334E\304\345I\235P\306\325~{\b*\202\203_\257\213O\333\357\252Y_-6\366\214\262\217\210\000JU\225\324H!`Q%f\243:\334\220\254\3047H\334\3408\213\036\2637\250d\017\214\2037\324P\363\023E\000\211D!\232U\262\006\332\034\341,\222J\324\370\304@_\332\'\313\023\322o\336\222\305p\350\353\v\240\371\343\230\315\253\311\023}g(\v3Y\353\024\230\215\270\033\\\365\205\203\266\267\351\005\222\004\230\306M\247:\021\221_wm\031\360\227\247\271gd\352Xa\307\267\230\374\004u\320\333\022\b7,\343\262\363\232b\265/\215/\371\374V\265\311\342\357\363g6{z+\363o-)Q\314\327\026\225\351T\215;\000L\321\b\243\004\367I_\342\213\264\215<\002\035\027\030\200\260\002\241\b:\374\017zh\020\357npMvm\t\352\\\353#R\212\371\204\032\373vV\250;\345+\234c>4P\335\213\217\022\213?p{\027\346t\324\006\236;\216\301\305\215-T,\247/\346\277\223\261\367\266\003%I\224e\374x\327\212\312\026\322\250%\230\226N=\204\331`2\244t\027*3]\r\023\357\362\327\253\205\211y\216Y\213\b\026\227^\316\212\225#\023\001)\232\004B$\"j\301\326\035\035w\225\277\f\357az\225\354\020\006\264z\215\233x\224\341\231\351\211\b\2104\316\2063\024]\372\005\202\n\020\221\\\310\305\b\254X\004\\\240z\342ya\324:\307\331\021\245/{\312\032*\371\324\213\211f\023\300\244mH]\217u\256\021x\331\226wS\317\2110\3755RE<\242(_T\"\354z#9\033\321\277\033\017\002\f\'/H\266a\366\304>\361`U\213\220\037\212\364\236\252\270h\021\307\204}\364G\214H\366\227u\261