oogle,\n  onSignOut,\n  onChangeAvatar,\n  onEnterMuseum,\n  onOpenCatalog,\n  onOpenUpload,\n  onOpenAccess,\n  onSwitchMuseum,\n  onInspectArtwork,\n}: HomeStudioProps) {"
