=f1e204]:\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e205]: SHARED EXHIBITIONS \302\267 COLLABORATIVE VISITS\n        - heading \"Invite companions to walk your museum together\" [level=2] [ref=f1e206]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e207]: Grant private access by email or share your gallery code. Each visitor enters with their chosen Man or Woman 3D model, exploring your framed photographs and paintings side by side.\n        - button \"Manage Access & Join Museum\" [ref=f1e208] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=f1e214]:\n        - button [ref=f1e215] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e216]: ACTIVE GALLERY \302\267 MUS-742A\n          - heading \"The Grand Private Gallery\" [level=3] [ref=f1e217]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e218]: Curated by Julian Vance\n        - generic [ref=f1e219]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e220]:\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e221]: AUTHORIZED ROSTER\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e222]: 1 Invited Visitor\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e223]: Clara Moreau (Woman)\n          - button \"Add or manage visitors \342\206\222\" [ref=f1e224] [cursor=pointer]\n    - generic [ref=f1e226]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e227]:\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e228]: 01 \302\267 MULTI-ROOM ARCHITECTURE\n        - heading \"8 walls per room, new rooms auto-built\" [level=3] [ref=f1e229]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e230]: Each museum room holds 8 framed walls with its own unique architectural shape and floral vase centerpiece. Exceeding 8 artworks automatically creates a new connected room.\n      - generic [ref=f1e231]:\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e232]: 02 \302\267 DOORS & CUSTOM SIGNBOARDS\n        - heading \"Open doors & name every room\" [level=3] [ref=f1e233]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e234]: Press F or Space (or click) near any connecting double door to swing it open and walk into the next room. Click the gilded signboard above any doorway to give that room a custom name.\n      - generic [ref=f1e235]:\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e236]: 03 \302\267 PRIVATE CLOUD ISOLATION\n        - heading \"Your own private gallery account\" [level=3] [ref=f1e237]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e238]: Sign in with Google so every uploaded artwork and room name saves strictly to your personal Firebase account. Nobody else sees your museum unless you invite them.\n  - contentinfo [ref=f1e239]:\n    - generic [ref=f1e240]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e241]: My Museum\n      - generic [ref=f1e242]: 3D Architectural Gallery \302\267 Personal & Shared Exhibitions\n```\n\n### Log (.playwright-cli/console-2026-11-22T02-06-12-640Z.log#L1-L1)\n```\n[     787ms] [INFO] %cDownload the React DevTools for a better development experience: https://react.dev/link/react-devtools font-weight:bold @ http://localhost:3000/node_modules/.vite/deps/react-dom_client.js?v=4c677c48:15801\n```\n\n### Log (.playwright-cli/console-2026-11-22T02-06-30-184Z.log#L1-L2)\n```\n[     447ms] [INFO] %cDownload the React DevTools for a better development experience: https://react.dev/link/react-devtools font-weight:bold @ http://localhost:3000/node_modules/.vite/deps/react-dom_client.js?v=4c677c48:15801\n[    4583ms] [WARNING] [2026-11-22T02:06:34.766Z]  @firebase/auth: Auth (13.4.0): Failed to initialize current user: Error: DB_TIMEOUT @ http://localhost:3000/node_modules/.vite/deps/index.esm-D4l25PIj.js?v=4c677c48:1575\n```\n"
