  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Screenshots**\n\nI\'m impressed by the clean hierarchy in `verify_access_modal.png`. It\'s well-organized with the \"Copy Invite Link\" and \"Copy Code\" options situated perfectly near the \"Pass Code.\" The inclusion of Visitor details (Name, Email, 3D Avatar), Permission Level, Personal Note, and the clear call to actions (\"Preview & Send Email Invite\" and \"Add Only\") is excellent. The layout is very well-considered.\n\n\n**Evaluating the Design Details**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into the specifics, especially the \"Email\" button\'s clear visibility in the Authorized Visitors list. The `verify_invite_confirm.png` dialog feels like an authentic museum invitation. I also love the visual preview of the actual email, including the personal note, and the bronze CTA. Finally, the design of the `verify_invite_landing.png` banner on the direct link is really well-executed and feels very professional, with the dark obsidian bar and bronze border. I think it\'s time to clean up those temporary files now.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "T08Ca_PCKu_Uz7IP29ypiAI"
    tool_calls {
