  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Tracing the Root Cause**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the exact error message: \"Please check your Firebase configuration.\" This happened due to a problem with how `set_up_oauth` executed earlier, specifically concerning the `project_id`. The Firebase configuration is now under closer inspection.\n\n\n**Analyzing Configuration Conflict**\n\nI\'ve discovered `set_up_oauth` replaced `firebase-applet-config.json` with a different project ID, leading to the Firebase configuration issue. This means the Firestore database I provisioned isn\'t being used. I am investigating `/firebase-applet-config.json`, `/src/firebase.ts`, and the `SKILL.md` files for both `firebase-integration-rpc` and `workspace-integration` skills to understand how Firebase and Workspace OAuth interact and if there\'s an issue with Firebase initialization in this context. I also want to verify `ultra-mode`.\n\n\n"
