  planner_response {
    response: "Fixed the Firestore permission error when initializing a new user\'s private cloud museum.\n\n### Cause & Fix\n- **Cause**: On first sign-in, checking whether your personal museum document (`museums/museum_<uid>`) already exists evaluated `resource.data` inside the `museums/{museumId}` `allow get` rule when the document did not exist yet (`resource == null`), causing Firestore to reject the check with `Missing or insufficient permissions.`.\n- **Fix**:\n  - Updated the `allow get` rule on `/museums/{museumId}` to safely allow a signed-in user to check existence of their own not-yet-created personal museum document (`resource == null && museumId == \'museum_\' + request.auth.uid`) while keeping all other museum reads strictly restricted to owners and authorized visitors.\n  - Added a matching `resource != null` guard on `/museums/{museumId}/members/{memberId}` `allow get`.\n  - Validated `firestore.rules` with ESLint security rules (0 warnings/errors), deployed the updated rules, and verified clean TypeScript build and browser load.\n\n*(Feel free to review and further tailor `firestore.rules` before sharing your app widely.)*"
    message_id: "1lsCa9jmIpeHqtsP9qSE8QY"
    modified_response: "Fixed the Firestore permission error when initializing a new user\'s private cloud museum.\n\n### Cause & Fix\n- **Cause**: On first sign-in, checking whether your personal museum document (`museums/museum_<uid>`) already exists evaluated `resource.data` inside the `museums/{museumId}` `allow get` rule when the document did not exist yet (`resource == null`), causing Firestore to reject the check with `Missing or insufficient permissions.`.\n- **Fix**:\n  - Updated the `allow get` rule on `/museums/{museumId}` to safely allow a signed-in user to check existence of their own not-yet-created personal museum document (`resource == null && museumId == \'museum_\' + request.auth.uid`) while keeping all other museum reads strictly restricted to owners and authorized visitors.\n  - Added a matching `resource != null` guard on `/museums/{museumId}/members/{memberId}` `allow get`.\n  - Validated `firestore.rules` with ESLint security rules (0 warnings/errors), deployed the updated rules, and verified clean TypeScript build and browser load.\n\n*(Feel free to review and further tailor `firestore.rules` before sharing your app widely.)*"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\310\002\n\305\002\001i\024}\023.\343\243\"8}\bDa\032\275\354\017Zv\252\301\327\213\351\t_\306\252\301\355\242\275\206\361\016\2008\240\377\364\025\370\'\334\027\336\000(h`|\225\341\345K\b\360\264\267\356\200\370\026oX\311UU\275\265T){\312}\177\016\r\a\353\320\202\212-B\260&!5\230%/b&\206y~\220\344\264\001\030VI\331\017\214=\267kJ9\\\302\'D\027\300\211}\311V\256\325\245\t$\315\231L\374_eU\321Y\311Gw_F\252k\332\033\275z\267\262\340~\266\n\n\330\3160\324\255\a\221\255\312\343B\r7\314S\240\023\274|\305\244c\200\"\254\370\211\024\202\205\032\334\026:\232\307\306p\000\310\1771g\304\230\314~T3\377\36644\257~b\353j|\267\302c\fa^;\256\324\276L\204\2541K\2745l%A\327\330\261xk\'\352\017\322\300\371a\024\032\332C\241gFO\2137\032\020:9Z<\364\035\016z\340\336<3\203\n\217\026\236tr_V!\257\364\243\320\312^\037\346\337!b\315\337oH\a\344l\200\000WO\027\203\225\005\252r\264\301P=\326\375\314\305*\357F\241\001\333\330A\037"
