  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nWe are implementing an **Exclusive Personal 3D Character Model strictly locked to `abidsarker213@gmail.com`** in **\"My Museum\"** (React + TypeScript + Three.js + Firebase Auth/Firestore + Gmail OAuth).\n- **Active User Request (Banglish)**:\n  > `https://studio.tripo3d.ai/3d-model/bca99e5e-94d8-4496-ae11-dab79a275a2d?utm_campaign=3d_model&invite_code=KHEUCE`\n  > \"ami chai ami abidsarker213@gmail.com diye jokhn connect korbo tokhn only amr amr ei modelta thakbe muesum e dhukle jno amr ei model e hatte pare shob korte pare\"\n- **User Uploaded Reference Video**:\n  - Local file path: `/public/assets/aistudio/tripo-showcase-bca99e5e-94d8-4496-ae11-dab79a275a2d_2cd94ade.mp4` (served at `/assets/aistudio/tripo-showcase-bca99e5e-94d8-4496-ae11-dab79a275a2d_2cd94ade.mp4`).\n  - **Visual Reference from 4 Video Frames (00:00\342\200\22300:03, full 360\302\260 turnaround)**:\n    - Young South Asian man with warm golden-brown skin (`#B87D58`).\n    - Thick jet-black modern hair (`#161515`), fuller textured swept volume on top, tapered sides & clean back hairline.\n    - Full neat dark-black moustache + sculpted chin & jawline beard, subtle friendly smile.\n    - Iconic thin **rose-silver/champagne-metallic rectangular eyeglasses** (`#DEC2B4`) with slender temples.\n    - **Burgundy/maroon & deep indigo-navy checkered plaid button-down shirt**, worn **untucked** with curved shirt hem, spread collar (top button open), center front button placket, and **rolled-up 3/4 sleeves** exposing bare forearms.\n    - **Dark charcoal/slate wristwatch/band** on the **left wrist**.\n    - Crisp **off-white / ivory tailored chino trousers** (`#F1EEE7`).\n    - **Dark charcoal-grey casual sneakers** (`#34373D`) with **crisp off-white rubber soles** (`#ECE9E0`).\n- **Success Criteria**:\n  1. **Strict Account Exclusivity**: ONLY when connected with `abidsarker213@gmail.com` is Abid\'s exclusive 3D signature model active (`outfitStyle: \'abid_signature\'`, `hairStyle: \'abid_signature\'`). Guests and all other Google accounts NEVER get or see Abid\'s exclusive model (they keep the standard Man/Woman customizable avatar studio).\n  2. **Zero-Setup Articulated Walking 3D Model**: Out-of-the-box, Abid\'s exclusive model is a bespoke, high-craft composite Three.js articulated 3D character matching EVERY visual detail of his Tripo 360\302\260 showcase (plaid texture shirt, rolled sleeves, bare forearms, left wristwatch, rose-silver glasses, beard/moustache, hair, ivory chinos, charcoal white-sole sneakers) that walks smoothly (`WASD`/Arrows/D-pad), turns, opens doors (`F`/`Space`/click), renames room signboards, inspects & uploads artworks, and broadcasts live presence.\n  3. **Optional Exact Tripo `.GLB` Upload (Exclusive to `abidsarker213@gmail.com`)**: Because Tripo Studio\'s API requires Tripo credentials (`{\"code\":1002,\"message\":\"Authentication failed\"}`), also let `abidsarker213@gmail.com` optionally load his exported `.glb` file from Tripo Studio (persisted locally in IndexedDB, loaded via `GLTFLoader` with automatic ground-centering, 1.76m height normalization, `AnimationMixer` if rigged, or smooth dynamic walk bounce/sway if unrigged) plus a 1-click reset to the articulated signature model and a toggleable reference preview of his uploaded 360\302\260 video (`/assets/aistudio/tripo-showcase-bca99e5e-94d8-4496-ae11-dab79a275a2d_2cd94ade.mp4`).\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed & Verified Earlier in Session\n- Real Gmail Invitation Emails (`src/services/gmailService.ts`, `AccessModal.tsx` explicit confirmation preview, `HomeStudio.tsx` Private Invitation Banner, `App.tsx` direct `?invite=...` link unlock).\n- Provisioned Firestore in `gen-lang-client-0648146997` (`firestoreDatabaseId: \"ai-studio-4448e632-eec0-4913-b187-f3889bfb35d4\"`) alongside Gmail OAuth (`oAuthClientId`), fixed `resource == null` null-dereference in `firestore.rules` `/museums/{museumId}` `allow get`, validated with `npx eslint firestore.rules` (0 errors), and deployed rules via `fax.DeployRules`.\n\n### Skills & References Already Read This Turn\n- `/skills/system_skills/threejs/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/threejs/references/loaders.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/threejs/references/animation.md`\n\n### Completed File Edits for Current Task (Not Yet Tested/Compiled)\n1. **Created `/src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.ts`**:\n   - Exports `EXCLUSIVE_ABID_EMAIL = \'abidsarker213@gmail.com\'`, `ABID_SIGNATURE_STYLE = \'abid_signature\'`, `ABID_SIGNATURE_VIDEO_URL`, `ABID_TRIPO_SOURCE_URL`.\n   - Exports `isExclusiveAbidAccount(email)`, `isAbidSignatureAvatar(avatar)`, `getAbidSignatureAvatar(displayName)`, and `enforceAccountAvatarPolicy(avatar, userEmail)`.\n2. **Created `/src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.test.ts`**:\n   - Unit tests for case-insensitive email match, locking `abidsarker213@gmail.com` to `abid_signature`, and stripping `abid_signature` for guests & other emails. **Not yet run.**\n3. **Created `/src/services/customModelStore.ts`**:\n   - IndexedDB store (`mymuseum_custom_models_v1`) exporting `saveCustomGlbForAccount`, `loadCustomGlbForAccount`, `clearCustomGlbForAccount` (keyed by email).\n4. **Updated `/src/three/proceduralTextures.ts`**:\n   - Added `createAbidPlaidTexture(repeatX = 3, repeatY = 3)` generating a 256\303\227256 woven burgundy/claret/deep-indigo-navy tartan plaid `THREE.CanvasTexture` (`SRGBColorSpace`, `RepeatWrapping`).\n\n### Remaining Work (Not Yet Modified)\n1. **`/src/three/avatarBuilder.ts`**:\n   - Extend `AvatarRig` interface with optional `mixer?: THREE.AnimationMixer`, `isCustomGlb?: boolean`, and `glbInner?: THREE.Object3D`.\n   - Add `buildAbidSignatureRig(config, options)` (called automatically by `buildAvatarRig` whenever `isAbidSignatureAvatar(config)` is true):\n     - Uses `createAbidPlaidTexture()` on untucked plaid shirt torso + curved shirt hem + spread collar + open neck V + center front button placket + small dark buttons.\n     - Rolled-up 3/4 plaid upper sleeves + folded plaid elbow cuffs + warm golden-brown bare forearms (`#B87D58`) + sculpted hands + **dark charcoal wristwatch/strap on left wrist**.\n     - Ivory/off-white tailored chinos (`#F1EEE7`) on articulated left/right leg pivots (`hipY = 0.88`).\n     - Charcoal-grey casual sneakers (`#34373D`) with crisp off-white rubber soles (`#ECE9E0`) and toe caps.\n     - Sculpted head: golden-brown skin, expressive dark eyes, brows, nose, **sculpted dark-black moustache + neat jawline/chin beard**, thick jet-black side-swept textured hair crown + tapered sides/back, and **rose-silver rectangular eyeglasses** (`#DEC2B4`, metalness `0.78`, roughness `0.22`) with slender temples!\n     - Grounded flush at `y = 0` with soft contact shadow and optional floating nameplate (`Ashfaq Sarker Abid \302\267 Exclusive 3D Model`).\n   - Add `buildCustomGlbAvatarRig(glbBuffer: ArrayBuffer, config: AvatarConfig, options?)`:\n     - Uses `GLTFLoader` (`import { GLTFLoader } from \'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js\'`) via `loader.parse(glbBuffer.slice(0), \'\', onLoad, onError)`.\n     - Computes `Box3`, centers horizontally (`x=0, z=0`), sets bottom flush at `y = 0`, normalizes height to `1.76m`, enables `castShadow`/`receiveShadow`, sets `envMapIntensity = 0.7`, attaches contact shadow & optional nameplate.\n     - If `gltf.animations.length > 0`, creates `THREE.AnimationMixer` and plays the walk/first clip (scaled by speed in `animateAvatarRig`).\n     - Properly disposes all cloned/loaded geometries, materials, and textures on `dispose()`.\n   - Update `animateAvatarRig(rig, speed, elapsed, delta)`:\n     - If `rig.isCustomGlb`: updates `rig.mixer` (if present, pausing/slowing when idle) AND applies smooth gait bounce + gentle stride hip-sway roll + subtle forward walk lean to `rig.bodyGroup` when moving (or gentle idle breathing when standing still) so even an unrigged Tripo `.glb` visibly walks!\n     - Otherwise runs the full articulated limb stride animation (legs, arms, torso bob, idle breathing).\n2. **`/src/components/AvatarPreview3D.tsx`**:\n   - Accept optional `customGlbBuffer?: ArrayBuffer | null` and `isExclusiveModel?: boolean` props.\n   - When `customGlbBuffer` is provided, asynchronously build `buildCustomGlbAvatarRig(...)` (with cancellation guard so rapid swaps never leak) and fall back cleanly to `buildAvatarRig(...)` on error; otherwise build `buildAvatarRig(...)` synchronously.\n   - Update top-left badge to show `\"Exclusive 3D Model\"` when `isExclusiveModel` is true.\n3. **`/src/components/Museum3DView.tsx`**:\n   - Accept optional `customGlbBuffer?: ArrayBuffer | null` prop.\n   - Update the player avatar `useEffect` (lines 884\342\200\223897) to load `buildCustomGlbAvatarRig` asynchronously when `customGlbBuffer` is provided (with cancellation guard & graceful fallback to `buildAvatarRig`), otherwise use `buildAvatarRig` synchronously.\n4. **`/src/components/HomeStudio.tsx`**:\n   - Accept new props: `isExclusiveAbid: boolean`, `customGlbName: string | null`, `onUploadCustomGlb: (file: File) => Promise<void>`, `onClearCustomGlb: () => Promise<void>`.\n   - Pass `customGlbBuffer` / `isExclusiveModel={isExclusiveAbid}` to `AvatarPreview3D`.\n   - When `isExclusiveAbid` is `true` (ONLY for `abidsarker213@gmail.com`):\n     - Replace the generic Man/Woman gender/hair/outfit customizer controls with an exclusive **\"Your Personal 3D Signature Model\"** atelier card showing:\n       - Badge/eyebrow: `EXCLUSIVE PERSONAL MODEL \302\267 ABIDSARKER213@GMAIL.COM`\n       - Title: `Your personal 3D character is ready for the museum`\n       - Editable **Visitor Nameplate** (defaults to `Ashfaq Sarker Abid`).\n       - Clean outfit/model detail summary (Burgundy-Indigo Plaid Rolled-Sleeve Shirt \302\267 Rose-Silver Glasses \302\267 Ivory Chinos \302\267 Charcoal Sneakers \302\267 Full Walking Controls).\n       - Embedded compact **360\302\260 Tripo Reference Preview** toggle (plays `/assets/aistudio/tripo-showcase-bca99e5e-94d8-4496-ae11-dab79a275a2d_2cd94ade.mp4` muted/looping inside a sleek collapsible preview box so he can view his reference right beside the live 3D model!).\n       - Optional **\"Import Exported Tripo .GLB\"** file picker (`accept=\".glb,.gltf\"`) + **\"Reset to Articulated Walking Model\"** button when a `.glb` is loaded.\n       - Prominent **Enter 3D Museum \342\206\222** CTA!\n   - When `isExclusiveAbid` is `false`: keep the exact existing Man/Woman customization studio unchanged (ZERO trace of Abid\'s exclusive model for anyone else!).\n5. **`/src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Derive `isExclusiveAbid = isExclusiveAbidAccount(user?.email)`.\n   - Enforce `enforceAccountAvatarPolicy(...)` on sign-in, avatar edits, sign-out, and before `saveUserProfile` / `upsertPresence` so:\n     - When `abidsarker213@gmail.com` connects -> immediately loads/enforces `getAbidSignatureAvatar(...)`, syncs it to Firestore `users/{uid}`, and loads any saved `.glb` from `loadCustomGlbForAccount(user.email)`!\n     - When signed out OR any other user signs in -> clears `customGlbBuffer`, enforces standard Man/Woman avatar, never leaks Abid\'s model!\n   - Wire `handleUploadCustomGlb(file)` (validates `.glb` extension & size <= 35MB, reads `ArrayBuffer`, saves to IndexedDB for `abidsarker213@gmail.com`, updates state + toast) and `handleClearCustomGlb()`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Tripo Studio API Check**: `curl https://api.tripo3d.ai/v2/openapi/task/bca99e5e-94d8-4496-ae11-dab79a275a2d` returned `{\"code\":1002,\"message\":\"Authentication failed\"}` and the web showcase page is a client SPA without a public unauthenticated `.glb` link. Therefore, building the bespoke articulated 3D signature model matching all 4 angles of his uploaded video + offering an optional `.glb` import for his Tripo export gives him immediate, 100% reliable, zero-404 walking functionality AND optional exact raw-mesh import!\n- **Firestore Schema Compatibility**: `abid_signature` is 14 chars (matches `hairStyle` & `outfitStyle` `<= 32` in `firestore.rules`), `#B87D58`/`#161515`/`#5E2333`/`#EFECE5` are valid 7-char hex colors, `gender: \'man\'`, `accessory: \'glasses\'`. **NO changes to `firestore.rules` or `firebase-blueprint.json` are needed!**\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- Fixed earlier in session:\n  1. `Please check your Firebase configuration.` -> Resolved by provisioning Firestore inside `gen-lang-client-0648146997` via `fax.ProvisionFirebase` and deploying rules via `fax.DeployRules`.\n  2. `Missing or insufficient permissions.` on `ensurePersonalMuseum` -> Resolved by fixing `resource == null` null-dereference in `/firestore.rules` `/museums/{museumId}` `allow get` (`(resource == null && museumId == \'museum_\' + request.auth.uid) || (resource != null && canAccessMuseumData(existing()))`), linting with ESLint, and deploying via `fax.DeployRules`.\n- No errors encountered on the current exclusive 3D avatar task so far.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Dev server is running on port 3000 (`DISABLE_HMR=true`).\n- `/public/assets/aistudio/tripo-showcase-bca99e5e-94d8-4496-ae11-dab79a275a2d_2cd94ade.mp4` exists in the workspace.\n- `/src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.ts`, `/src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.test.ts`, `/src/services/customModelStore.ts`, and `createAbidPlaidTexture` in `/src/three/proceduralTextures.ts` are ready.\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Update `/src/three/avatarBuilder.ts`**:\n   - Add `buildAbidSignatureRig` (matching every detail of Abid\'s uploaded 360\302\260 video), `buildCustomGlbAvatarRig` (`GLTFLoader`), and update `animateAvatarRig` for both articulated rigs and custom GLB rigs.\n2. **Update `/src/components/AvatarPreview3D.tsx` and `/src/components/Museum3DView.tsx`**:\n   - Support optional `customGlbBuffer?: ArrayBuffer | null` (and `isExclusiveModel?: boolean` on `AvatarPreview3D`).\n3. **Update `/src/components/HomeStudio.tsx` and `/src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Enforce `isExclusiveAbidAccount(user?.email)` strictly, render Abid\'s Exclusive Signature 3D Model studio card (with optional Tripo 360\302\260 reference video toggle & optional `.glb` import/reset) ONLY when signed in as `abidsarker213@gmail.com`, and keep the standard Man/Woman studio for everyone else.\n4. **Run All Unit Tests**:\n   - `npx --yes tsx --test src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.test.ts src/museum/layout.test.ts src/services/gmailService.test.ts`\n5. **Compile, Restart Dev Server, and Visually Verify in Playwright**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` + `restart_dev_server`.\n   - Use `playwright-cli` (with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`):\n     - Verify guest Home Studio still shows standard Man/Woman customizer (NO exclusive Abid model leaked to non-Abid users!).\n     - Render and visually screenshot `buildAvatarRig(getAbidSignatureAvatar(\'Ashfaq Sarker Abid\'))` from front 3/4 AND rear 3/4 angles in real WebGL via Playwright `page.evaluate` (importing `/src/three/avatarBuilder.ts` + `/src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.ts` on localhost dev server) AND verify walking stride animation moves legs/arms cleanly without clipping! Stage screenshots into `.playwright-cli/`, inspect EVERY screenshot with `view_file` (critique glasses, beard, plaid shirt, rolled sleeves, watch, white chinos, charcoal white-sole sneakers), fix any visual flaw if spotted, and clean up temp screenshots.\n     - Verify entering 3D Museum and walking with `W` key works cleanly with zero console errors.\n6. **Final Verification Gate**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together in the same turn, then present a concise summary to the user.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Strict Exclusivity**: NEVER expose Abid\'s personal 3D model to guests or other email accounts (no public URL preview backdoors). Only `abidsarker213@gmail.com` gets it.\n- **Three.js Discipline**: Zero 404s, proper `SRGBColorSpace` on procedural textures, full `.dispose()` cleanup, zero GC in animation loop, software-WebGL safe (`isSoftwareGl`), no `backdrop-filter` over WebGL.\n- **Ultra Mode**: Run all unit tests, visually inspect Playwright screenshots with `view_file`, close Playwright cleanly, and co-execute `compile_applet` + `lint_applet` before finishing.\n</summary>"
