  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining The Vision**\n\nI\'m now laser-focused on `/src/three/avatarBuilder.ts`, aiming for exceptional craftsmanship and visual fidelity, directly inspired by Abid\'s Tripo 360\302\260 reference video. I\'m meticulously double-checking every detail of Abid\'s character, starting with proportions and pose.\n\n\n**Defining Physical Attributes**\n\nI\'ve established the foundational physical details, starting with realistic proportions: 1.76m height, grounded at `y=0`. I\'m going with broad, athletic shoulders and a natural, relaxed posture with arms slightly away from the hips and a natural gait pivot. I\'m aiming for a warm, golden-brown skin tone (`#B87D58`). I\'ve started on the burgundy/deep indigo plaid shirt with a spread collar and open neck, and 3/4 rolled sleeves.\n\n\n**Detailing Limb Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the finer points of the arms. I\'m visualizing the rolled plaid cuffs, positioned just above the elbows at y = -0.25, exposing the bare forearms, which have that warm golden-brown skin. I\'m also planning a dark charcoal wristwatch with a sleek metallic bezel on the left wrist. I\'ve re-verified the right-hand rule, and confirmed the placement of the wristwatch on the character\'s left wrist. Sculpting the hands with realistic thumb details is my next task.\n\n\n**Constructing Apparel Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the off-white tailored chino trousers, ensuring a smooth taper and subtle cuff above the sneakers, and ensuring the color matches with `#F1EEE7`. The matching ivory pelvis/hip block will be seamlessly hidden under the shirt. Now, it\'s onto the footwear: Dark charcoal-grey sneakers with off-white rubber soles, rounded dark toe caps, and subtle off-white lace panel accents. I\'m making sure the soles sit flush at y = 0.\n\n\n**Adding Facial Details**\n\nNow I\'m focusing on the face. I\'m adding a sculpted chin beard that tapers into sideburns and a jet-black textured hairstyle. I\'m also adding rose-silver rectangular eyeglasses, constructed with thin metallic bars and translucent lenses. I\'ll make sure it\'s all accurate to rectangular eyeglasses. Lastly, when the nameplate is enabled, I\'ll render the display name or default to \'Ashfaq Sarker Abid\'.\n\n\n**Implementing Custom GLB Loader**\n\nI\'m now integrating a custom `.GLB` loader, leveraging `GLTFLoader` to parse the buffer. I\'ve focused on ensuring the loader properly calculates the bounding box for the loaded GLB, normalizes the model\'s scale to the desired height (1.76m), and centers it at (0, 0, 0) with the base at y = 0. I\'ve also implemented shadow casting and receiving, and set the environment map intensity. Finally, I\'m wrapping the model, adding a contact shadow and nameplate, and animating if animations are available.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "pWICa8erD7Hqz7IPsPng-AI"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_17952464780317642777"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add Abid\'s exclusive articulated 3D signature model, optional GLB loader rig, and custom GLB walk animation support in avatarBuilder.ts\", \"Instruction\":\"Extend AvatarRig, dispatch abid_signature to buildAbidSignatureRig, add buildCustomGlbAvatarRig via GLTFLoader, and update animateAvatarRig\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":28, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport { GLTFLoader } from \'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js\';\\nimport type { AvatarConfig } from \'../types/museum\';\\nimport { isAbidSignatureAvatar } from \'../museum/exclusiveAvatar\';\\nimport {\\n  createAbidPlaidTexture,\\n  createContactShadowTexture,\\n  createNameplateTexture,\\n} from \'./proceduralTextures\';\\n\\nexport interface AvatarRig {\\n  root: THREE.Group;\\n  bodyGroup: THREE.Group;\\n  headGroup: THREE.Group;\\n  leftArmPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  rightArmPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  leftLegPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  rightLegPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  stridePhase: number;\\n  maxLegSwing: number;\\n  mixer?: THREE.AnimationMixer;\\n  isCustomGlb?: boolean;\\n  dispose: () => void;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Builds a high-craft composite procedural 3D human avatar (16+ distinct sculpted parts)\\n * differentiated cleanly by Gender (\'man\' vs \'woman\'), hair style, tailored wardrobe,\\n * skin tone, colors, and curator accessories. Pivoted flush at bottom-center (y = 0).\\n */\\nexport function buildAvatarRig(\\n  config: AvatarConfig,\\n  options?: { showNameplate?: boolean; showContactShadow?: boolean }\\n): AvatarRig {\\n  if (isAbidSignatureAvatar(config)) {\\n    return buildAbidSignatureRig(config, options);\\n  }\\n\\n  const root = new THREE.Group();\\n  const bodyGroup = new THREE.Group();\", \"StartLine\":1, \"TargetContent\":\"import * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport type { AvatarConfig } from \'../types/museum\';\\nimport { createContactShadowTexture, createNameplateTexture } from \'./proceduralTextures\';\\n\\nexport interface AvatarRig {\\n  root: THREE.Group;\\n  bodyGroup: THREE.Group;\\n  headGroup: THREE.Group;\\n  leftArmPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  rightArmPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  leftLegPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  rightLegPivot: THREE.Group;\\n  stridePhase: number;\\n  maxLegSwing: number;\\n  dispose: () => void;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Builds a high-craft composite procedural 3D human avatar (16+ distinct sculpted parts)\\n * differentiated cleanly by Gender (\'man\' vs \'woman\'), hair style, tailored wardrobe,\\n * skin tone, colors, and curator accessories. Pivoted flush at bottom-center (y = 0).\\n */\\nexport function buildAvatarRig(\\n  config: AvatarConfig,\\n  options?: { showNameplate?: boolean; showContactShadow?: boolean }\\n): AvatarRig {\\n  const root = new THREE.Group();\\n  const bodyGroup = new THREE.Group();\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":746, \"ReplacementContent\":\"/**\\n * Builds Abid\'s exclusive, fully articulated 3D signature character strictly matching his\\n * 360-degree Tripo showcase: burgundy/indigo plaid rolled-sleeve untucked shirt, dark wristwatch\\n * on the left wrist, crisp ivory tailored chinos, charcoal-grey casual sneakers with off-white\\n * rubber soles, golden-brown complexion, sculpted dark beard & moustache, thick side-swept\\n * jet-black hair, and thin rose-silver rectangular eyeglasses.\\n */\\nfunction buildAbidSignatureRig(\\n  config: AvatarConfig,\\n  options?: { showNameplate?: boolean; showContactShadow?: boolean }\\n): AvatarRig {\\n  const root = new THREE.Group();\\n  const bodyGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n  root.add(bodyGroup);\\n\\n  const disposables: { dispose: () => void }[] = [];\\n  const trackGeo = <T extends THREE.BufferGeometry>(g: T): T => {\\n    disposables.push(g);\\n    return g;\\n  };\\n  const trackMat = <T extends THREE.Material>(m: T): T => {\\n    disposables.push(m);\\n    return m;\\n  };\\n  const trackTex = <T extends THREE.Texture>(t: T): T => {\\n    disposables.push(t);\\n    return t;\\n  };\\n\\n  // Calibrated PBR materials matched to Abid\'s reference turnaround\\n  const skinMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xb87d58,\\n      roughness: 0.58,\\n      metalness: 0.02,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const hairMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x161515,\\n      roughness: 0.48,\\n      metalness: 0.06,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const beardMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x1a1717,\\n      roughness: 0.76,\\n      metalness: 0.02,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const plaidTex = trackTex(createAbidPlaidTexture(2.6, 2.6));\\n  const shirtMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      map: plaidTex,\\n      roughness: 0.82,\\n      metalness: 0.03,\\n      side: THREE.DoubleSide,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const sleevePlaidTex = trackTex(createAbidPlaidTexture(1.5, 1.5));\\n  const sleeveMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      map: sleevePlaidTex,\\n      roughness: 0.82,\\n      metalness: 0.03,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const placketMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x451b26,\\n      roughness: 0.82,\\n      metalness: 0.03,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const buttonMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x20181a,\\n      roughness: 0.35,\\n      metalness: 0.12,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const chinoMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xf1eee7,\\n      roughness: 0.84,\\n      metalness: 0.02,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const sneakerUpperMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x34373d,\\n      roughness: 0.64,\\n      metalness: 0.04,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const sneakerSoleMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xece9e0,\\n      roughness: 0.76,\\n      metalness: 0.02,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const watchBandMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x262a30,\\n      roughness: 0.45,\\n      metalness: 0.18,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const watchBezelMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x5c636e,\\n      roughness: 0.28,\\n      metalness: 0.72,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const watchDialMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x101216,\\n      roughness: 0.16,\\n      metalness: 0.25,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const glassesFrameMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xdec2b4,\\n      roughness: 0.22,\\n      metalness: 0.78,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const glassesLensMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xf4f7fb,\\n      roughness: 0.08,\\n      metalness: 0.12,\\n      transparent: true,\\n      opacity: 0.16,\\n      depthWrite: false,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const darkEyeMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x171311,\\n      roughness: 0.16,\\n      metalness: 0.1,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const scleraMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xf5f2ec,\\n      roughness: 0.3,\\n      metalness: 0.0,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  const lipMat = trackMat(\\n    new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0x864c40,\\n      roughness: 0.52,\\n      metalness: 0.04,\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  // Soft grounded contact shadow at y = 0.015\\n  if (options?.showContactShadow !== false) {\\n    const shadowTex = trackTex(createContactShadowTexture());\\n    const shadowPlane = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CircleGeometry(0.46, 24)),\\n      trackMat(\\n        new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\\n          map: shadowTex,\\n          transparent: true,\\n          depthWrite: false,\\n          opacity: 0.72,\\n        })\\n      )\\n    );\\n    shadowPlane.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\\n    shadowPlane.position.y = 0.015;\\n    root.add(shadowPlane);\\n  }\\n\\n  // --- LEGS: Ivory tailored chinos + charcoal sneakers with crisp white soles ---\\n  const hipY = 0.88;\\n  const hipSpread = 0.114;\\n\\n  const makeLeg = (side: -1 | 1) => {\\n    const pivot = new THREE.Group();\\n    pivot.position.set(side * hipSpread, hipY, 0);\\n\\n    // Thigh (tailored chino)\\n    const thigh = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.084, 0.068, 0.43, 16)),\\n      chinoMat\\n    );\\n    thigh.position.y = -0.21;\\n    thigh.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(thigh);\\n\\n    // Calf / tapered lower chino\\n    const calf = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.066, 0.052, 0.37, 16)),\\n      chinoMat\\n    );\\n    calf.position.y = -0.585;\\n    calf.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(calf);\\n\\n    // Subtle ankle cuff roll\\n    const ankleHem = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.055, 0.054, 0.032, 16)),\\n      chinoMat\\n    );\\n    ankleHem.position.y = -0.765;\\n    pivot.add(ankleHem);\\n\\n    // Bare ankle bridge into sneaker collar\\n    const ankle = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.042, 0.04, 0.045, 12)),\\n      skinMat\\n    );\\n    ankle.position.y = -0.79;\\n    pivot.add(ankle);\\n\\n    // Crisp off-white rubber sneaker outsole (flush at y = 0 -> local -hipY)\\n    const soleBase = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.114, 0.026, 0.245)),\\n      sneakerSoleMat\\n    );\\n    soleBase.position.set(0, -hipY + 0.013, 0.05);\\n    soleBase.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(soleBase);\\n\\n    const soleToe = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.056, 0.057, 0.026, 14)),\\n      sneakerSoleMat\\n    );\\n    soleToe.position.set(0, -hipY + 0.013, 0.168);\\n    pivot.add(soleToe);\\n\\n    // Dark charcoal sneaker upper\\n    const shoeUpper = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.106, 0.064, 0.215)),\\n      sneakerUpperMat\\n    );\\n    shoeUpper.position.set(0, -hipY + 0.056, 0.042);\\n    shoeUpper.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(shoeUpper);\\n\\n    const shoeToe = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.054, 14, 12)),\\n      sneakerUpperMat\\n    );\\n    shoeToe.scale.set(0.98, 0.68, 1.18);\\n    shoeToe.position.set(0, -hipY + 0.048, 0.148);\\n    shoeToe.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(shoeToe);\\n\\n    // Crisp lace / tongue highlight\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\\n      const lace = new THREE.Mesh(\\n        trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.042, 0.006, 0.009)),\\n        sneakerSoleMat\\n      );\\n      lace.position.set(0, -hipY + 0.088 - i * 0.008, 0.095 + i * 0.024);\\n      lace.rotation.x = 0.25;\\n      pivot.add(lace);\\n    }\\n\\n    bodyGroup.add(pivot);\\n    return pivot;\\n  };\\n\\n  const leftLegPivot = makeLeg(-1);\\n  const rightLegPivot = makeLeg(1);\\n\\n  // --- PELVIS (Ivory chino seat seamlessly tucked under untucked shirt hem) ---\\n  const pelvis = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.184, 0.18, 0.17, 18)),\\n    chinoMat\\n  );\\n  pelvis.scale.set(1.04, 1, 0.72);\\n  pelvis.position.y = 0.91;\\n  pelvis.castShadow = true;\\n  bodyGroup.add(pelvis);\\n\\n  // --- TORSO: Untucked Burgundy & Deep-Indigo Plaid Button-Down Shirt ---\\n  const torsoMain = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.228, 0.196, 0.54, 22)),\\n    shirtMat\\n  );\\n  torsoMain.scale.set(1.06, 1, 0.68);\\n  torsoMain.position.y = 1.21;\\n  torsoMain.castShadow = true;\\n  bodyGroup.add(torsoMain);\\n\\n  // Untucked gently flared shirt hem skirt overlapping top of ivory chinos\\n  const shirtHem = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.198, 0.208, 0.15, 22)),\\n    shirtMat\\n  );\\n  shirtHem.scale.set(1.06, 1, 0.71);\\n  shirtHem.position.y = 0.895;\\n  shirtHem.castShadow = true;\\n  bodyGroup.add(shirtHem);\\n\\n  // Sculpted shoulder yoke\\n  const shoulderYoke = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.224, 18, 12, 0, Math.PI * 2, 0, Math.PI * 0.48)),\\n    shirtMat\\n  );\\n  shoulderYoke.scale.set(1.12, 0.42, 0.7);\\n  shoulderYoke.position.y = 1.44;\\n  bodyGroup.add(shoulderYoke);\\n\\n  // Center front button placket & small dark buttons\\n  const placket = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.032, 0.56, 0.018)),\\n    placketMat\\n  );\\n  placket.position.set(0, 1.15, 0.144);\\n  bodyGroup.add(placket);\\n\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\\n    const btn = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.0065, 0.0065, 0.008, 10)),\\n      buttonMat\\n    );\\n    btn.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\\n    btn.position.set(0, 1.37 - i * 0.11, 0.155);\\n    bodyGroup.add(btn);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Open-top spread collar + warm visible upper chest V\\n  const openChestV = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.068, 0.025, 0.14, 12)),\\n    skinMat\\n  );\\n  openChestV.scale.set(1, 1, 0.58);\\n  openChestV.position.set(0, 1.47, 0.072);\\n  bodyGroup.add(openChestV);\\n\\n  const collarBack = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.086, 0.098, 0.078, 16, 1, true, Math.PI * 0.35, Math.PI * 1.3)),\\n    shirtMat\\n  );\\n  collarBack.position.set(0, 1.505, -0.005);\\n  bodyGroup.add(collarBack);\\n\\n  for (const s of [-1, 1]) {\\n    const collarPoint = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.066, 0.074, 0.016)),\\n      shirtMat\\n    );\\n    collarPoint.position.set(s * 0.062, 1.485, 0.105);\\n    collarPoint.rotation.z = s * 0.42;\\n    collarPoint.rotation.y = -s * 0.28;\\n    bodyGroup.add(collarPoint);\\n  }\\n\\n  // --- ARMS: Rolled-Up 3/4 Plaid Sleeves + Bare Forearms + Left Wristwatch ---\\n  const shoulderY = 1.43;\\n  const shoulderX = 0.252;\\n\\n  const makeArm = (side: -1 | 1) => {\\n    const pivot = new THREE.Group();\\n    pivot.position.set(side * shoulderX, shoulderY, 0);\\n\\n    // Shoulder cap (plaid)\\n    const cap = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.064, 14, 12)),\\n      sleeveMat\\n    );\\n    cap.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(cap);\\n\\n    // Upper sleeve (plaid, extending down to elbow)\\n    const upperSleeve = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.06, 0.052, 0.27, 14)),\\n      sleeveMat\\n    );\\n    upperSleeve.position.y = -0.135;\\n    upperSleeve.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(upperSleeve);\\n\\n    // Rolled-up plaid cuff band right below elbow\\n    const rolledCuff = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.057, 0.055, 0.055, 14)),\\n      sleeveMat\\n    );\\n    rolledCuff.position.y = -0.265;\\n    rolledCuff.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(rolledCuff);\\n\\n    // Bare warm golden-brown forearm\\n    const forearm = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.044, 0.034, 0.25, 14)),\\n      skinMat\\n    );\\n    forearm.position.y = -0.405;\\n    forearm.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(forearm);\\n\\n    // Anatomical left wrist (side === +1 when facing +Z) wears dark wristwatch\\n    if (side === 1) {\\n      const strap = new THREE.Mesh(\\n        trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.0385, 0.0375, 0.024, 14)),\\n        watchBandMat\\n      );\\n      strap.position.y = -0.505;\\n      pivot.add(strap);\\n\\n      const watchCase = new THREE.Mesh(\\n        trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.02, 0.02, 0.012, 14)),\\n        watchBezelMat\\n      );\\n      watchCase.rotation.z = Math.PI / 2;\\n      watchCase.position.set(0.036, -0.505, 0.01);\\n      pivot.add(watchCase);\\n\\n      const watchDial = new THREE.Mesh(\\n        trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.016, 0.016, 0.0135, 14)),\\n        watchDialMat\\n      );\\n      watchDial.rotation.z = Math.PI / 2;\\n      watchDial.position.set(0.037, -0.505, 0.01);\\n      pivot.add(watchDial);\\n    }\\n\\n    // Sculpted hand & thumb\\n    const hand = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.043, 12, 10)),\\n      skinMat\\n    );\\n    hand.scale.set(0.82, 1.18, 0.68);\\n    hand.position.y = -0.575;\\n    hand.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(hand);\\n\\n    const thumb = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.011, 0.01, 0.042, 8)),\\n      skinMat\\n    );\\n    thumb.position.set(-side * 0.028, -0.555, 0.022);\\n    thumb.rotation.z = side * 0.35;\\n    thumb.rotation.x = 0.25;\\n    pivot.add(thumb);\\n\\n    bodyGroup.add(pivot);\\n    return pivot;\\n  };\\n\\n  const leftArmPivot = makeArm(-1);\\n  const rightArmPivot = makeArm(1);\\n\\n  // --- NECK, HEAD, BEARD/MOUSTACHE, HAIR & ROSE-SILVER GLASSES ---\\n  const headGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n  headGroup.position.set(0, 1.59, 0);\\n  bodyGroup.add(headGroup);\\n\\n  const neck = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.056, 0.065, 0.14, 14)),\\n    skinMat\\n  );\\n  neck.position.y = -0.045;\\n  headGroup.add(neck);\\n\\n  // Sculpted head cranium + natural jawline\\n  const head = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.135, 22, 20)),\\n    skinMat\\n  );\\n  head.scale.set(0.95, 1.1, 0.99);\\n  head.position.y = 0.115;\\n  head.castShadow = true;\\n  headGroup.add(head);\\n\\n  // Ears\\n  for (const s of [-1, 1]) {\\n    const ear = new THREE.Mesh(trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.024, 10, 10)), skinMat);\\n    ear.scale.set(0.46, 1.24, 0.82);\\n    ear.position.set(s * 0.128, 0.106, -0.006);\\n    headGroup.add(ear);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Expressive Eyes & Eyebrows\\n  for (const s of [-1, 1]) {\\n    const sclera = new THREE.Mesh(trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.0155, 10, 10)), scleraMat);\\n    sclera.scale.set(1.25, 0.72, 0.55);\\n    sclera.position.set(s * 0.044, 0.126, 0.116);\\n    headGroup.add(sclera);\\n\\n    const iris = new THREE.Mesh(trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.0105, 10, 10)), darkEyeMat);\\n    iris.position.set(s * 0.044, 0.126, 0.122);\\n    headGroup.add(iris);\\n\\n    const brow = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.041, 0.0095, 0.012)),\\n      hairMat\\n    );\\n    brow.position.set(s * 0.045, 0.155, 0.121);\\n    brow.rotation.z = s * 0.04;\\n    headGroup.add(brow);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Sculpted Nose\\n  const noseBridge = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.018, 0.046, 0.024)),\\n    skinMat\\n  );\\n  noseBridge.position.set(0, 0.112, 0.128);\\n  noseBridge.rotation.x = -0.14;\\n  headGroup.add(noseBridge);\\n\\n  const noseTip = new THREE.Mesh(trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.015, 10, 10)), skinMat);\\n  noseTip.scale.set(1.15, 0.85, 0.95);\\n  noseTip.position.set(0, 0.09, 0.138);\\n  headGroup.add(noseTip);\\n\\n  // Subtle friendly mouth\\n  const mouth = new THREE.Mesh(trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.046, 0.009, 0.01)), lipMat);\\n  mouth.position.set(0, 0.056, 0.123);\\n  headGroup.add(mouth);\\n\\n  // Sculpted Dark-Black Moustache & Neat Full Chin/Jawline Beard\\n  for (const s of [-1, 1]) {\\n    const stacheHalf = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.032, 0.012, 0.014)),\\n      beardMat\\n    );\\n    stacheHalf.position.set(s * 0.017, 0.071, 0.125);\\n    stacheHalf.rotation.z = -s * 0.16;\\n    stacheHalf.rotation.y = -s * 0.18;\\n    headGroup.add(stacheHalf);\\n\\n    // Tapered jawline / cheek beard connecting chin cleanly up toward sideburns\\n    const jawBeard = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.028, 0.078, 0.068)),\\n      beardMat\\n    );\\n    jawBeard.position.set(s * 0.096, 0.048, 0.052);\\n    jawBeard.rotation.y = -s * 0.56;\\n    jawBeard.rotation.z = s * 0.18;\\n    headGroup.add(jawBeard);\\n\\n    const sideburn = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.016, 0.064, 0.032)),\\n      hairMat\\n    );\\n    sideburn.position.set(s * 0.119, 0.112, 0.025);\\n    headGroup.add(sideburn);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Sculpted rounded chin beard cup (lower jaw only, leaves lips crisp)\\n  const chinBeard = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.078, 16, 14, 0, Math.PI * 2, Math.PI * 0.48, Math.PI * 0.52)),\\n    beardMat\\n  );\\n  chinBeard.scale.set(1.12, 1.02, 0.96);\\n  chinBeard.position.set(0, 0.052, 0.062);\\n  headGroup.add(chinBeard);\\n\\n  const soulPatch = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.026, 0.016, 0.014)),\\n    beardMat\\n  );\\n  soulPatch.position.set(0, 0.041, 0.124);\\n  headGroup.add(soulPatch);\\n\\n  // Thick Jet-Black Textured Modern Hair (fuller side-swept top, clean tapered back & sides)\\n  const hairCap = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.141, 22, 16, 0, Math.PI * 2, 0, Math.PI * 0.46)),\\n    hairMat\\n  );\\n  hairCap.scale.set(0.97, 1.05, 1.02);\\n  hairCap.position.set(0, 0.148, -0.02);\\n  hairCap.rotation.x = -0.32;\\n  hairCap.castShadow = true;\\n  headGroup.add(hairCap);\\n\\n  // Back cranial hair cleanly covering nape\\n  const hairBack = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.132, 18, 14)),\\n    hairMat\\n  );\\n  hairBack.scale.set(0.95, 1.04, 0.85);\\n  hairBack.position.set(0, 0.132, -0.044);\\n  hairBack.castShadow = true;\\n  headGroup.add(hairBack);\\n\\n  // Textured fuller swept crown waves matching Abid\'s silhouette\\n  const crownWaveMain = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.088, 14, 12)),\\n    hairMat\\n  );\\n  crownWaveMain.scale.set(1.22, 0.62, 1.24);\\n  crownWaveMain.position.set(-0.015, 0.238, 0.018);\\n  crownWaveMain.rotation.z = 0.12;\\n  crownWaveMain.rotation.x = -0.14;\\n  crownWaveMain.castShadow = true;\\n  headGroup.add(crownWaveMain);\\n\\n  const crownWaveRight = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.068, 12, 10)),\\n    hairMat\\n  );\\n  crownWaveRight.scale.set(1.05, 0.56, 1.15);\\n  crownWaveRight.position.set(0.056, 0.228, 0.01);\\n  crownWaveRight.rotation.z = -0.18;\\n  headGroup.add(crownWaveRight);\\n\\n  const frontQuiff = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.056, 12, 10)),\\n    hairMat\\n  );\\n  frontQuiff.scale.set(1.42, 0.54, 0.92);\\n  frontQuiff.position.set(-0.022, 0.224, 0.078);\\n  frontQuiff.rotation.x = -0.22;\\n  frontQuiff.rotation.z = 0.1;\\n  headGroup.add(frontQuiff);\\n\\n  // Thin Rose-Silver Metallic Rectangular Eyeglasses (signature detail from video)\\n  const lensW = 0.056;\\n  const lensH = 0.036;\\n  const frameT = 0.0042;\\n  const lensZ = 0.141;\\n  const lensY = 0.126;\\n\\n  for (const s of [-1, 1]) {\\n    const cx = s * 0.046;\\n\\n    // Top & bottom horizontal bars\\n    const topBar = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(lensW + frameT, frameT, frameT)),\\n      glassesFrameMat\\n    );\\n    topBar.position.set(cx, lensY + lensH / 2, lensZ);\\n    headGroup.add(topBar);\\n\\n    const botBar = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(lensW + frameT, frameT, frameT)),\\n      glassesFrameMat\\n    );\\n    botBar.position.set(cx, lensY - lensH / 2, lensZ);\\n    headGroup.add(botBar);\\n\\n    // Outer & inner vertical bars\\n    const outerBar = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(frameT, lensH, frameT)),\\n      glassesFrameMat\\n    );\\n    outerBar.position.set(cx + s * (lensW / 2), lensY, lensZ);\\n    headGroup.add(outerBar);\\n\\n    const innerBar = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(frameT, lensH, frameT)),\\n      glassesFrameMat\\n    );\\n    innerBar.position.set(cx - s * (lensW / 2), lensY, lensZ);\\n    headGroup.add(innerBar);\\n\\n    // Subtle reflective glass lens plane\\n    const lensPane = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(lensW - 0.004, lensH - 0.004)),\\n      glassesLensMat\\n    );\\n    lensPane.position.set(cx, lensY, lensZ - 0.001);\\n    headGroup.add(lensPane);\\n\\n    // Slender rose-silver temple arm extending back to ear\\n    const temple = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.0038, 0.0045, 0.135)),\\n      glassesFrameMat\\n    );\\n    temple.position.set(s * 0.098, lensY + 0.004, 0.072);\\n    temple.rotation.y = -s * 0.16;\\n    headGroup.add(temple);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Nasal bridge connecting the two rectangular frames\\n  const bridge = new THREE.Mesh(\\n    trackGeo(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.036, frameT, frameT)),\\n    glassesFrameMat\\n  );\\n  bridge.position.set(0, lensY + 0.005, lensZ + 0.002);\\n  headGroup.add(bridge);\\n\\n  // Floating nameplate sprite in museum view\\n  if (options?.showNameplate) {\\n    const labelTex = trackTex(\\n      createNameplateTexture(\\n        config.displayName || \'Ashfaq Sarker Abid\',\\n        \'Exclusive 3D Model\'\\n      )\\n    );\\n    const spriteMat = trackMat(\\n      new THREE.SpriteMaterial({\\n        map: labelTex,\\n        transparent: true,\\n        depthTest: false,\\n      })\\n    );\\n    const sprite = new THREE.Sprite(spriteMat);\\n    sprite.scale.set(0.96, 0.24, 1);\\n    sprite.position.set(0, 2.08, 0);\\n    root.add(sprite);\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    root,\\n    bodyGroup,\\n    headGroup,\\n    leftArmPivot,\\n    rightArmPivot,\\n    leftLegPivot,\\n    rightLegPivot,\\n    stridePhase: 0,\\n    maxLegSwing: 0.48,\\n    dispose: () => {\\n      for (const item of disposables) {\\n        item.dispose();\\n      }\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Loads an exported binary .GLB 3D character mesh (e.g. exported from Tripo Studio) via GLTFLoader,\\n * normalizes its height to 1.76m, centers & grounds it flush at y = 0, hooks up embedded walk\\n * animations if present, and provides smooth locomotion motion even for static unrigged meshes.\\n */\\nexport async function buildCustomGlbAvatarRig(\\n  glbBuffer: ArrayBuffer,\\n  config: AvatarConfig,\\n  options?: { showNameplate?: boolean; showContactShadow?: boolean }\\n): Promise<AvatarRig> {\\n  const loader = new GLTFLoader();\\n  const gltf = await new Promise<{ scene: THREE.Group; animations: THREE.AnimationClip[] }>(\\n    (resolve, reject) => {\\n      loader.parse(\\n        glbBuffer.slice(0),\\n        \'\',\\n        (result) => resolve(result),\\n        (err) => reject(err instanceof Error ? err : new Error(\'Invalid GLB 3D model file\'))\\n      );\\n    }\\n  );\\n\\n  const root = new THREE.Group();\\n  const bodyGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n  root.add(bodyGroup);\\n\\n  const disposables: { dispose: () => void }[] = [];\\n  const trackGeo = <T extends THREE.BufferGeometry>(g: T): T => {\\n    disposables.push(g);\\n    return g;\\n  };\\n  const trackMat = <T extends THREE.Material>(m: T): T => {\\n    disposables.push(m);\\n    return m;\\n  };\\n  const trackTex = <T extends THREE.Texture>(t: T): T => {\\n    disposables.push(t);\\n    return t;\\n  };\\n\\n  const model = gltf.scene;\\n  model.updateMatrixWorld(true);\\n  const rawBox = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(model);\\n  const rawSize = new THREE.Vector3();\\n  const rawCenter = new THREE.Vector3();\\n  rawBox.getSize(rawSize);\\n  rawBox.getCenter(rawCenter);\\n\\n  const targetHeight = 1.76;\\n  const maxDim = Math.max(rawSize.y, 0.001);\\n  const scale = targetHeight / maxDim;\\n  model.scale.setScalar(scale);\\n\\n  // Re-measure after scaling so feet rest flush at y = 0 and X/Z are centered\\n  model.updateMatrixWorld(true);\\n  const scaledBox = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(model);\\n  const scaledCenter = new THREE.Vector3();\\n  scaledBox.getCenter(scaledCenter);\\n  model.position.set(-scaledCenter.x, -scaledBox.min.y, -scaledCenter.z);\\n\\n  model.traverse((obj) => {\\n    if ((obj as THREE.Mesh).isMesh) {\\n      const mesh = obj as THREE.Mesh;\\n      mesh.castShadow = true;\\n      mesh.receiveShadow = true;\\n      const mats = Array.isArray(mesh.material) ? mesh.material : [mesh.material];\\n      for (const m of mats) {\\n        if (m && \'envMapIntensity\' in m) {\\n          (m as THREE.MeshStandardMaterial).envMapIntensity = 0.72;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  bodyGroup.add(model);\\n\\n  // Soft grounded contact shadow\\n  if (options?.showContactShadow !== false) {\\n    const shadowTex = trackTex(createContactShadowTexture());\\n    const shadowPlane = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      trackGeo(new THREE.CircleGeometry(0.48, 24)),\\n      trackMat(\\n        new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\\n          map: shadowTex,\\n          transparent: true,\\n          depthWrite: false,\\n          opacity: 0.72,\\n        })\\n      )\\n    );\\n    shadowPlane.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\\n    shadowPlane.position.y = 0.015;\\n    root.add(shadowPlane);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Optional floating nameplate sprite\\n  if (options?.showNameplate) {\\n    const labelTex = trackTex(\\n      createNameplateTexture(\\n        config.displayName || \'Ashfaq Sarker Abid\',\\n        \'Custom Tripo GLB Model\'\\n      )\\n    );\\n    const spriteMat = trackMat(\\n      new THREE.SpriteMaterial({\\n        map: labelTex,\\n        transparent: true,\\n        depthTest: false,\\n      })\\n    );\\n    const sprite = new THREE.Sprite(spriteMat);\\n    sprite.scale.set(0.96, 0.24, 1);\\n    sprite.position.set(0, 2.08, 0);\\n    root.add(sprite);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Optional embedded skeletal animation mixer (if the exported GLB is rigged)\\n  let mixer: THREE.AnimationMixer | undefined;\\n  if (gltf.animations && gltf.animations.length > 0) {\\n    mixer = new THREE.AnimationMixer(model);\\n    const preferred =\\n      gltf.animations.find((clip) => /walk|stride|run|move/i.test(clip.name)) ??\\n      gltf.animations[0];\\n    const action = mixer.clipAction(preferred);\\n    action.play();\\n  }\\n\\n  // Placeholder pivot groups satisfy the shared AvatarRig interface\\n  const headGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n  const leftArmPivot = new THREE.Group();\\n  const rightArmPivot = new THREE.Group();\\n  const leftLegPivot = new THREE.Group();\\n  const rightLegPivot = new THREE.Group();\\n\\n  return {\\n    root,\\n    bodyGroup,\\n    headGroup,\\n    leftArmPivot,\\n    rightArmPivot,\\n    leftLegPivot,\\n    rightLegPivot,\\n    stridePhase: 0,\\n    maxLegSwing: 0.48,\\n    mixer,\\n    isCustomGlb: true,\\n    dispose: () => {\\n      mixer?.stopAllAction();\\n      model.traverse((obj) => {\\n        if ((obj as THREE.Mesh).isMesh) {\\n          const mesh = obj as THREE.Mesh;\\n          mesh.geometry?.dispose();\\n          const mats = Array.isArray(mesh.material) ? mesh.material : [mesh.material];\\n          for (const mat of mats) {\\n            if (!mat) continue;\\n            const std = mat as THREE.MeshStandardMaterial;\\n            std.map?.dispose();\\n            std.normalMap?.dispose();\\n            std.roughnessMap?.dispose();\\n            std.metalnessMap?.dispose();\\n            std.aoMap?.dispose();\\n            std.emissiveMap?.dispose();\\n            mat.dispose();\\n          }\\n        }\\n      });\\n      for (const item of disposables) {\\n        item.dispose();\\n      }\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Smoothly animates walking stride or gentle idle breathing without allocating garbage.\\n */\\nexport function animateAvatarRig(\\n  rig: AvatarRig,\\n  speed: number,\\n  elapsed: number,\\n  delta: number\\n): void {\\n  const isMoving = speed > 0.08;\\n  const clampedDelta = Math.min(delta, 0.1);\\n  const damping = 1 - Math.exp(-10 * clampedDelta);\\n\\n  if (rig.isCustomGlb) {\\n    if (rig.mixer) {\\n      rig.mixer.update(isMoving ? clampedDelta * Math.max(0.85, speed * 0.32) : 0);\\n    }\\n    if (isMoving) {\\n      rig.stridePhase += clampedDelta * Math.min(11, 5.5 + speed * 1.15);\\n      const bob = Math.abs(Math.cos(rig.stridePhase)) * (rig.mixer ? 0.018 : 0.048);\\n      const swayZ = Math.sin(rig.stridePhase) * (rig.mixer ? 0.018 : 0.042);\\n      const leanX = rig.mixer ? 0.02 : 0.05;\\n      rig.bodyGroup.position.y += (bob - rig.bodyGroup.position.y) * damping;\\n      rig.bodyGroup.rotation.z += (swayZ - rig.bodyGroup.rotation.z) * damping;\\n      rig.bodyGroup.rotation.x += (leanX - rig.bodyGroup.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    } else {\\n      const breathe = Math.sin(elapsed * 2.1) * 0.008;\\n      rig.bodyGroup.position.y += (breathe - rig.bodyGroup.position.y) * damping;\\n      rig.bodyGroup.rotation.z += (0 - rig.bodyGroup.rotation.z) * damping;\\n      rig.bodyGroup.rotation.x += (0 - rig.bodyGroup.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\\n  if (isMoving) {\\n    rig.stridePhase += clampedDelta * Math.min(11, 5.2 + speed * 1.15);\\n    const swing = Math.sin(rig.stridePhase) * rig.maxLegSwing;\\n    const armSwing = Math.sin(rig.stridePhase) * 0.38;\\n    const bob = Math.abs(Math.cos(rig.stridePhase)) * 0.028;\\n\\n    rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x += (swing - rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x += (-swing - rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x += (-armSwing - rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x += (armSwing - rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.bodyGroup.position.y += (bob - rig.bodyGroup.position.y) * damping;\\n  } else {\\n    const breathe = Math.sin(elapsed * 2.1) * 0.008;\\n    rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x += (0 - rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x += (0 - rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x += (0.04 * Math.sin(elapsed * 1.4) - rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x += (-0.04 * Math.sin(elapsed * 1.4) - rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.bodyGroup.position.y += (breathe - rig.bodyGroup.position.y) * damping;\\n  }\\n}\", \"StartLine\":714, \"TargetContent\":\"/**\\n * Smoothly animates walking stride or gentle idle breathing without allocating garbage.\\n */\\nexport function animateAvatarRig(\\n  rig: AvatarRig,\\n  speed: number,\\n  elapsed: number,\\n  delta: number\\n): void {\\n  const isMoving = speed > 0.08;\\n  const damping = 1 - Math.exp(-10 * Math.min(delta, 0.1));\\n\\n  if (isMoving) {\\n    rig.stridePhase += delta * Math.min(11, 5.2 + speed * 1.15);\\n    const swing = Math.sin(rig.stridePhase) * rig.maxLegSwing;\\n    const armSwing = Math.sin(rig.stridePhase) * 0.38;\\n    const bob = Math.abs(Math.cos(rig.stridePhase)) * 0.028;\\n\\n    rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x += (swing - rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x += (-swing - rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x += (-armSwing - rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x += (armSwing - rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.bodyGroup.position.y += (bob - rig.bodyGroup.position.y) * damping;\\n  } else {\\n    const breathe = Math.sin(elapsed * 2.1) * 0.008;\\n    rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x += (0 - rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x += (0 - rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x += (0.04 * Math.sin(elapsed * 1.4) - rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x += (-0.04 * Math.sin(elapsed * 1.4) - rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x) * damping;\\n    rig.bodyGroup.position.y += (breathe - rig.bodyGroup.position.y) * damping;\\n  }\\n}\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/three/avatarBuilder.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating avatarBuilder with exclusive 3D model and GLB loader\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update avatarBuilder.ts\"}"
