  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Component Implementations**\n\nI\'m now focusing on updating `/src/components/AvatarPreview3D.tsx` and `/src/components/Museum3DView.tsx` in parallel. For `AvatarPreview3D.tsx`, I\'m adding optional props: `customGlbBuffer`, which can be an `ArrayBuffer` or `null`, and `isExclusiveModel`. This looks like it\'ll streamline some of the content handling.\n\n\n**Refining Avatar Loading Logic**\n\nI\'m making progress on the avatar hot-swap effect. I\'m incorporating a `cancelled` flag within the `useEffect`. When a `customGlbBuffer` is provided, I\'ll now asynchronously call `buildCustomGlbAvatarRig`, guarding against cancellation before attaching the result. I also have error handling and a clean fallback to the regular avatar rig. When the buffer is null or undefined, the standard synchronous approach is used. I\'ve also implemented the \"Exclusive\" badge display based on the `isExclusiveModel` prop.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "NWMCa57nOOqiqtsP7sCgMQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3787528880485585877"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Support customGlbBuffer and isExclusiveModel in AvatarPreview3D\", \"Instruction\":\"Add customGlbBuffer and isExclusiveModel props, async GLB rig loading with cancellation, and exclusive badge label\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":16, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import {\\n  buildAvatarRig,\\n  buildCustomGlbAvatarRig,\\n  type AvatarRig,\\n} from \'../three/avatarBuilder\';\\nimport { createAfterDrawScheduler, detectSoftwareGl } from \'../three/webglUtils\';\\n\\ninterface AvatarPreview3DProps {\\n  avatar: AvatarConfig;\\n  customGlbBuffer?: ArrayBuffer | null;\\n  isExclusiveModel?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport function AvatarPreview3D({\\n  avatar,\\n  customGlbBuffer = null,\\n  isExclusiveModel = false,\\n}: AvatarPreview3DProps) {\", \"StartLine\":7, \"TargetContent\":\"import { buildAvatarRig, type AvatarRig } from \'../three/avatarBuilder\';\\nimport { createAfterDrawScheduler, detectSoftwareGl } from \'../three/webglUtils\';\\n\\ninterface AvatarPreview3DProps {\\n  avatar: AvatarConfig;\\n}\\n\\nexport function AvatarPreview3D({ avatar }: AvatarPreview3DProps) {\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":287, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Hot-swap sculpted 3D avatar (or exclusive Tripo GLB) without tearing down WebGL\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const slot = avatarSlotRef.current;\\n    if (!slot) return;\\n    let cancelled = false;\\n\\n    const mountRig = (nextRig: AvatarRig) => {\\n      if (cancelled) {\\n        nextRig.dispose();\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (currentRigRef.current) {\\n        slot.remove(currentRigRef.current.root);\\n        currentRigRef.current.dispose();\\n      }\\n      slot.add(nextRig.root);\\n      currentRigRef.current = nextRig;\\n      requestRenderRef.current?.();\\n    };\\n\\n    if (customGlbBuffer) {\\n      void buildCustomGlbAvatarRig(customGlbBuffer, avatar, {\\n        showNameplate: false,\\n        showContactShadow: true,\\n      })\\n        .then(mountRig)\\n        .catch(() => {\\n          mountRig(buildAvatarRig(avatar, { showNameplate: false, showContactShadow: true }));\\n        });\\n    } else {\\n      mountRig(buildAvatarRig(avatar, { showNameplate: false, showContactShadow: true }));\\n    }\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      cancelled = true;\\n    };\\n  }, [avatar, customGlbBuffer]);\", \"StartLine\":274, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Hot-swap sculpted 3D avatar when customization changes without tearing down WebGL\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const slot = avatarSlotRef.current;\\n    if (!slot) return;\\n    if (currentRigRef.current) {\\n      slot.remove(currentRigRef.current.root);\\n      currentRigRef.current.dispose();\\n    }\\n    const nextRig = buildAvatarRig(avatar, { showNameplate: false, showContactShadow: true });\\n    slot.add(nextRig.root);\\n    currentRigRef.current = nextRig;\\n    requestRenderRef.current?.();\\n  }, [avatar]);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":318, \"ReplacementContent\":\"          <span className=\\\"text-[#D4B282]\\\">\\n            {isExclusiveModel\\n              ? customGlbBuffer\\n                ? \'Exclusive Tripo GLB Model\'\\n                : \'Exclusive 3D Model\'\\n              : avatar.gender === \'woman\'\\n                ? \'Woman 3D Model\'\\n                : \'Man 3D Model\'}\\n          </span>\", \"StartLine\":313, \"TargetContent\":\"          <span className=\\\"text-[#D4B282]\\\">\\n            {avatar.gender === \'woman\' ? \'Woman 3D Model\' : \'Man 3D Model\'}\\n          </span>\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AvatarPreview3D.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating AvatarPreview3D for exclusive & GLB models\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update AvatarPreview3D.tsx\"}"
