  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Parallel Design**\n\nI\'m now focusing on simultaneous updates to `/src/components/HomeStudio.tsx` and `/src/App.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m designing the Exclusive Personal 3D Model panel for `HomeStudio.tsx`, which should appear only when `isExclusiveAbid` is true (meaning it is an ab email address).\n\n\n**Designing Exclusive Features**\n\nI\'m expanding the design for the exclusive personal 3D model panel. It requires a refined, museum-grade aesthetic. The left column will feature an `AvatarPreview3D` component. The right column, displayed only when `isExclusiveAbid` is true, will include an eyebrow with the user\'s email, a title, a subtitle, an editable visitor nameplate input, and a two-column architectural specification block. This block details signature wardrobe elements and active 3D rig mode.\n\n\n**Adding Tripo GLB Imports**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating a Tripo 360\302\260 reference and .GLB importer. This involves a toggle for previewing an embedded video and a file picker for .GLB uploads. I\'ll also add an option to reset to the articulated model if a custom .GLB is loaded. Error handling and loading feedback are essential. The CTA will be adapted to reflect entering the museum. I\'m also ensuring that, for non-exclusive users, there\'s absolutely no mention of Abid or his model; the standard customization studio will render as is. I\'ll be importing isExclusiveAbidAccount into /src/App.tsx.\n\n\n**Implementing Exclusive Access**\n\nI\'m now integrating exclusive avatar policies. I\'m focusing on functions from `./museum/exclusiveAvatar` and `./services/customModelStore`. I\'ve set up state to manage `customGlbBuffer` and `customGlbName` specifically for Abid accounts. These will be cleared on sign-out or account switching. I\'m also ensuring that guest avatars are policy-checked on initial load. Inside `onAuthStateChanged`, I immediately clear the custom GLB data and load profiles with the appropriate policy, setting the avatar state accordingly.\n\n\n**Enforcing Avatar Policies**\n\nI\'m now implementing account avatar policies across multiple functions. When a profile isn\'t `abid_signature`, I\'ll save `enforcedAvatar` back to Firestore. I\'m also loading any previously imported `.glb` from IndexedDB and populating `customGlbBuffer` and `customGlbName` if it\'s still the active run. Furthermore, the `handleAvatarChange`, `handleEnterMuseum`, and `handlePositionBroadcast` functions are updated to apply the `enforceAccountAvatarPolicy`. I\'m building out `handleUploadCustomGlb`, focusing on guards and validation.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "smMCa6CAHKSlqtsPgbSKuAs"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11976328519005972122"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add Abid\'s exclusive personal 3D model atelier card with 360 reference toggle and optional Tripo GLB upload in HomeStudio.tsx\", \"Instruction\":\"Import exclusive model helpers and icons, extend HomeStudioProps, pass customGlbBuffer/isExclusiveModel to AvatarPreview3D, and conditionally render the exclusive studio panel ONLY when isExclusiveAbid is true\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":16, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import { useRef, useState, type ChangeEvent } from \'react\';\\nimport type { User } from \'firebase/auth\';\\nimport {\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  Calendar,\\n  ExternalLink,\\n  FolderKanban,\\n  LogOut,\\n  Mail,\\n  Play,\\n  Plus,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  Upload,\\n  Users,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { PendingMuseumInvite } from \'../services/gmailService\';\\nimport {\\n  ABID_SIGNATURE_VIDEO_URL,\\n  ABID_TRIPO_SOURCE_URL,\\n  EXCLUSIVE_ABID_EMAIL,\\n} from \'../museum/exclusiveAvatar\';\", \"StartLine\":1, \"TargetContent\":\"import type { User } from \'firebase/auth\';\\nimport {\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  Calendar,\\n  FolderKanban,\\n  LogOut,\\n  Mail,\\n  Plus,\\n  Users,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { PendingMuseumInvite } from \'../services/gmailService\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":60, \"ReplacementContent\":\"interface HomeStudioProps {\\n  user: User | null;\\n  authLoading: boolean;\\n  avatar: AvatarConfig;\\n  isExclusiveAbid: boolean;\\n  customGlbBuffer: ArrayBuffer | null;\\n  customGlbName: string | null;\\n  museum: MuseumMeta;\\n  artworks: ArtworkItem[];\\n  members: MuseumMember[];\\n  accessibleMuseums: MuseumMeta[];\\n  pendingInvite: PendingMuseumInvite | null;\\n  inviteBannerState: InviteBannerState;\\n  inviteBannerMessage: string | null;\\n  onDismissInvite: () => void;\\n  onSignInGoogle: () => void;\\n  onSignOut: () => void;\\n  onChangeAvatar: (next: AvatarConfig) => void;\\n  onUploadCustomGlb: (file: File) => Promise<void>;\\n  onClearCustomGlb: () => Promise<void>;\\n  onEnterMuseum: () => void;\\n  onOpenCatalog: () => void;\\n  onOpenUpload: () => void;\\n  onOpenAccess: () => void;\\n  onSwitchMuseum: (museumId: string) => void;\\n  onInspectArtwork: (artwork: ArtworkItem, slotIndex: number) => void;\\n}\", \"StartLine\":38, \"TargetContent\":\"interface HomeStudioProps {\\n  user: User | null;\\n  authLoading: boolean;\\n  avatar: AvatarConfig;\\n  museum: MuseumMeta;\\n  artworks: ArtworkItem[];\\n  members: MuseumMember[];\\n  accessibleMuseums: MuseumMeta[];\\n  pendingInvite: PendingMuseumInvite | null;\\n  inviteBannerState: InviteBannerState;\\n  inviteBannerMessage: string | null;\\n  onDismissInvite: () => void;\\n  onSignInGoogle: () => void;\\n  onSignOut: () => void;\\n  onChangeAvatar: (next: AvatarConfig) => void;\\n  onEnterMuseum: () => void;\\n  onOpenCatalog: () => void;\\n  onOpenUpload: () => void;\\n  onOpenAccess: () => void;\\n  onSwitchMuseum: (museumId: string) => void;\\n  onInspectArtwork: (artwork: ArtworkItem, slotIndex: number) => void;\\n}\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":112, \"ReplacementContent\":\"export function HomeStudio({\\n  user,\\n  authLoading,\\n  avatar,\\n  isExclusiveAbid,\\n  customGlbBuffer,\\n  customGlbName,\\n  museum,\\n  artworks,\\n  members,\\n  accessibleMuseums,\\n  pendingInvite,\\n  inviteBannerState,\\n  inviteBannerMessage,\\n  onDismissInvite,\\n  onSignInGoogle,\\n  onSignOut,\\n  onChangeAvatar,\\n  onUploadCustomGlb,\\n  onClearCustomGlb,\\n  onEnterMuseum,\\n  onOpenCatalog,\\n  onOpenUpload,\\n  onOpenAccess,\\n  onSwitchMuseum,\\n  onInspectArtwork,\\n}: HomeStudioProps) {\\n  const layout = calculateMuseumLayout(artworks.length);\\n  const recentArtworks = sortArtworksByDate(artworks, \'newest\').slice(0, 4);\\n  const hairOptions = HAIR_STYLES_BY_GENDER[avatar.gender];\\n  const outfitOptions = OUTFIT_STYLES_BY_GENDER[avatar.gender];\\n  const [showRefVideo, setShowRefVideo] = useState(false);\\n  const [glbBusy, setGlbBusy] = useState(false);\\n  const [glbError, setGlbError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const glbInputRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement | null>(null);\\n\\n  const handleGlbFilePicked = async (e: ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\\n    const file = e.target.files?.[0];\\n    e.target.value = \'\';\\n    if (!file) return;\\n    setGlbError(null);\\n    setGlbBusy(true);\\n    try {\\n      await onUploadCustomGlb(file);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      setGlbError(err instanceof Error ? err.message : \'Could not load that .GLB 3D model.\');\\n    } finally {\\n      setGlbBusy(false);\\n    }\\n  };\", \"StartLine\":84, \"TargetContent\":\"export function HomeStudio({\\n  user,\\n  authLoading,\\n  avatar,\\n  museum,\\n  artworks,\\n  members,\\n  accessibleMuseums,\\n  pendingInvite,\\n  inviteBannerState,\\n  inviteBannerMessage,\\n  onDismissInvite,\\n  onSignInGoogle,\\n  onSignOut,\\n  onChangeAvatar,\\n  onEnterMuseum,\\n  onOpenCatalog,\\n  onOpenUpload,\\n  onOpenAccess,\\n  onSwitchMuseum,\\n  onInspectArtwork,\\n}: HomeStudioProps) {\\n  const layout = calculateMuseumLayout(artworks.length);\\n  const recentArtworks = sortArtworksByDate(artworks, \'newest\').slice(0, 4);\\n  const hairOptions = HAIR_STYLES_BY_GENDER[avatar.gender];\\n  const outfitOptions = OUTFIT_STYLES_BY_GENDER[avatar.gender];\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":566, \"ReplacementContent\":\"          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-7 items-stretch\\\">\\n            {/* Left Dominant Anchor: Live 3D Avatar Preview Stage */}\\n            <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n              <AvatarPreview3D\\n                avatar={avatar}\\n                customGlbBuffer={isExclusiveAbid ? customGlbBuffer : null}\\n                isExclusiveModel={isExclusiveAbid}\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Right Column: Exclusive Personal 3D Model Atelier (abidsarker213@gmail.com ONLY) OR Standard Customizer */}\\n            <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-6 bg-white border border-stone-200 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n              {isExclusiveAbid ? (\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\" data-testid=\\\"exclusive-abid-panel\\\">\\n                  <div>\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-[#8A5A2B] tracking-wider mb-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                      <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                      EXCLUSIVE PERSONAL 3D MODEL \302\267 {EXCLUSIVE_ABID_EMAIL.toUpperCase()}\\n                    </p>\\n                    <h1 className=\\\"font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-[1.08] text-balance\\\">\\n                      Your personal 3D character is ready for the museum\\n                    </h1>\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-sm text-stone-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed max-w-xl\\\">\\n                      This custom 3D model is strictly locked to your Google account. Walk every room with WASD or Arrow keys, open doors with F or Space, rename room signboards, and curate your walls as your signature character.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Visitor Nameplate */}\\n                  <div>\\n                    <label\\n                      htmlFor=\\\"avatar-display-name\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1.5\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Visitor Nameplate\\n                    </label>\\n                    <input\\n                      id=\\\"avatar-display-name\\\"\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                      maxLength={80}\\n                      value={avatar.displayName}\\n                      onChange={(e) =>\\n                        onChangeAvatar({ ...avatar, displayName: e.target.value })\\n                      }\\n                      placeholder=\\\"Ashfaq Sarker Abid\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 bg-[#FAF8F4] border border-stone-300 text-sm text-stone-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#8A5A2B]\\\"\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Signature Specification Grid */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 bg-[#FAF8F4] border border-stone-200 p-4\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-[#8A5A2B] tracking-wider uppercase mb-1\\\">\\n                        Signature Styling\\n                      </p>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                        Burgundy &amp; indigo plaid rolled-sleeve shirt, rose-silver glasses, sculpted beard, left wristwatch, ivory chinos &amp; charcoal sneakers.\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-[#8A5A2B] tracking-wider uppercase mb-1\\\">\\n                        Active 3D Rig\\n                      </p>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-stone-900\\\">\\n                        {customGlbName\\n                          ? `Imported Tripo GLB (${customGlbName})`\\n                          : \'Articulated Full-Stride 3D Model\'}\\n                      </p>\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                        Private to your login \342\200\224 invisible to guests &amp; other accounts.\\n                      </p>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Tripo 360 Reference & Optional .GLB Importer */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"border border-stone-200 bg-[#F7F5F0] p-4 space-y-3\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n                      <div>\\n                        <p className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-stone-900\\\">\\n                          Tripo 3D Reference &amp; Optional .GLB Mesh Import\\n                        </p>\\n                        <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-stone-600 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                          Your articulated walking model is active now. You can also import your exported <span className=\\\"font-mono\\\">.glb</span> file from Tripo Studio anytime.\\n                        </p>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => setShowRefVideo((v) => !v)}\\n                        className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-white border border-stone-300 text-xs font-medium text-stone-800 hover:border-stone-500 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <Play className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-[#8A5A2B]\\\" />\\n                        {showRefVideo ? \'Hide 360\302\260 Clip\' : \'View 360\302\260 Reference\'}\\n                      </button>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {showRefVideo && (\\n                      <div className=\\\"bg-[#181512] border border-stone-300 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                        <video\\n                          src={ABID_SIGNATURE_VIDEO_URL}\\n                          autoPlay\\n                          loop\\n                          muted\\n                          playsInline\\n                          className=\\\"w-full max-h-56 object-contain mx-auto\\\"\\n                        />\\n                      </div>\\n                    )}\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                      <input\\n                        ref={glbInputRef}\\n                        type=\\\"file\\\"\\n                        accept=\\\".glb\\\"\\n                        onChange={handleGlbFilePicked}\\n                        className=\\\"hidden\\\"\\n                      />\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        disabled={glbBusy}\\n                        onClick={() => glbInputRef.current?.click()}\\n                        className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#1C1917] text-[#F7F5F0] text-xs font-medium hover:bg-stone-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-60\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <Upload className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                        {glbBusy\\n                          ? \'Loading .GLB...\'\\n                          : customGlbName\\n                            ? \'Replace Tripo .GLB\'\\n                            : \'Import Exported Tripo .GLB\'}\\n                      </button>\\n\\n                      {customGlbName && (\\n                        <button\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => void onClearCustomGlb()}\\n                          className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-white border border-stone-300 text-stone-800 text-xs font-medium hover:border-stone-500 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                          Use Articulated Model\\n                        </button>\\n                      )}\\n\\n                      <a\\n                        href={ABID_TRIPO_SOURCE_URL}\\n                        target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n                        rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\"\\n                        className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-[#8A5A2B] hover:text-[#66401B] underline underline-offset-4 ml-auto\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Tripo Model Page\\n                        <ExternalLink className=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" />\\n                      </a>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {glbError && (\\n                      <p className=\\\"text-xs text-red-700 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 px-3 py-2\\\">\\n                        {glbError}\\n                      </p>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              ) : (\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n                  <div>\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-[#8A5A2B] tracking-wider mb-1\\\">\\n                      STEP 01 \302\267 PERSONALIZE YOUR 3D VISITOR\\n                    </p>\\n                    <h1 className=\\\"font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-[1.08] text-balance\\\">\\n                      Craft your avatar before entering the gallery\\n                    </h1>\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-sm text-stone-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed max-w-xl\\\">\\n                      Select Man or Woman proportions, customize your hair, attire, and accessories, then walk through your expanding 3D art museum or visit shared collections.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Gender & Display Name */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <span className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1.5\\\">\\n                        3D Model Silhouette\\n                      </span>\\n                      <div\\n                        className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 p-1 bg-[#F3EFE8] border border-stone-200\\\"\\n                        role=\\\"group\\\"\\n                        aria-label=\\\"Choose avatar gender\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <button\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => handleGenderSwitch(\'man\')}\\n                          aria-pressed={avatar.gender === \'man\'}\\n                          className={`py-1.5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                            avatar.gender === \'man\'\\n                              ? \'bg-[#1C1917] text-[#F7F5F0]\'\\n                              : \'text-stone-700 hover:text-stone-950\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          Man Model\\n                        </button>\\n                        <button\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => handleGenderSwitch(\'woman\')}\\n                          aria-pressed={avatar.gender === \'woman\'}\\n                          className={`py-1.5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                            avatar.gender === \'woman\'\\n                              ? \'bg-[#1C1917] text-[#F7F5F0]\'\\n                              : \'text-stone-700 hover:text-stone-950\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        >\\n                          Woman Model\\n                        </button>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div>\\n                      <label\\n                        htmlFor=\\\"avatar-display-name\\\"\\n                        className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1.5\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Visitor Nameplate\\n                      </label>\\n                      <input\\n                        id=\\\"avatar-display-name\\\"\\n                        type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                        maxLength={80}\\n                        value={avatar.displayName}\\n                        onChange={(e) =>\\n                          onChangeAvatar({ ...avatar, displayName: e.target.value })\\n                        }\\n                        placeholder=\\\"Your name in the museum\\\"\\n                        className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 bg-[#FAF8F4] border border-stone-300 text-sm text-stone-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#8A5A2B]\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Hair Style & Attire Style */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <span className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1.5\\\">\\n                        Hair Style\\n                      </span>\\n                      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5\\\">\\n                        {hairOptions.map((opt) => (\\n                          <button\\n                            key={opt.id}\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => onChangeAvatar({ ...avatar, hairStyle: opt.id })}\\n                            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs border text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer truncate ${\\n                              avatar.hairStyle === opt.id\\n                                ? \'border-[#8A5A2B] bg-[#F5EFE6] text-stone-900 font-medium\'\\n                                : \'border-stone-200 bg-[#FAF8F4] text-stone-600 hover:border-stone-400\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {opt.label}\\n                          </button>\\n                        ))}\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div>\\n                      <span className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1.5\\\">\\n                        Gallery Attire\\n                      </span>\\n                      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5\\\">\\n                        {outfitOptions.map((opt) => (\\n                          <button\\n                            key={opt.id}\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => onChangeAvatar({ ...avatar, outfitStyle: opt.id })}\\n                            className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs border text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                              avatar.outfitStyle === opt.id\\n                                ? \'border-[#8A5A2B] bg-[#F5EFE6] text-stone-900 font-medium\'\\n                                : \'border-stone-200 bg-[#FAF8F4] text-stone-600 hover:border-stone-400\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            {opt.label}\\n                          </button>\\n                        ))}\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Color Swatches: Skin, Hair, Outfit, Accent */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5\\\">\\n                    <div>\\n                      <span className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1.5\\\">\\n                        Skin Tone\\n                      </span>\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\\\">\\n                        {SKIN_TONES.map((tone) => (\\n                          <button\\n                            key={tone.hex}\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => onChangeAvatar({ ...avatar, skinTone: tone.hex })}\\n                            aria-label={`Skin tone ${tone.label}`}\\n                            className={`w-6 h-6 border transition-transform cursor-pointer ${\\n                              avatar.skinTone === tone.hex\\n                                ? \'border-stone-950 scale-110 ring-2 ring-[#8A5A2B]/40\'\\n                                : \'border-stone-300 hover:scale-105\'\\n                            }`}\\n                            style={{ backgroundColor: tone.hex }}\\n                          />\\n                 