  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing Visual Re-Verification**\n\nI\'m now running the Playwright visual re-verification script on Abid\'s refined 3D model. I\'m focusing on the front 3/4, face/shirt closeup, rear 3/4, and full peak-stride walk perspectives. Afterward, I\'ll clean up the `.playwright-cli` screenshots after reviewing the results. I\'ve initiated the process; it should begin shortly.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "ymUCa6mVIbyymtkPw6bIuQQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12026816548824355674"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"bash -euo pipefail -c \'\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli\\ntrap \\\"playwright-cli close >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\\\" EXIT\\n\\nplaywright-cli open http://localhost:3000\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900\\nsleep 1.5\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.evaluate(async () => {\\n    const THREE = await import(\\\\\\\"/node_modules/three/build/three.module.js\\\\\\\");\\n    const { buildAvatarRig, animateAvatarRig } = await import(\\\\\\\"/src/three/avatarBuilder.ts\\\\\\\");\\n    const { getAbidSignatureAvatar } = await import(\\\\\\\"/src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.ts\\\\\\\");\\n\\n    const overlay = document.createElement(\\\\\\\"div\\\\\\\");\\n    overlay.style.cssText = \\\\\\\"position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:99999;background:#EBE6DD;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\\\\\\\";\\n    document.body.appendChild(overlay);\\n\\n    const w = 900, h = 760;\\n    const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, preserveDrawingBuffer: true });\\n    renderer.setSize(w, h);\\n    renderer.outputColorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n    renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\\n    renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.08;\\n    overlay.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\\n\\n    const scene = new THREE.Scene();\\n    scene.background = new THREE.Color(0xebe6dd);\\n    scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xf6f9ff, 0x8f7a64, 1.15));\\n    const key = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xfff1dc, 1.75);\\n    key.position.set(2.8, 4.8, 3.6);\\n    scene.add(key);\\n    const fill = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xdce8f8, 0.85);\\n    fill.position.set(-2.8, 3.0, -3.2);\\n    scene.add(fill);\\n\\n    const ped = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.82, 0.9, 0.16, 32),\\n      new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xf7f3eb, roughness: 0.35 })\\n    );\\n    ped.position.y = -0.08;\\n    scene.add(ped);\\n\\n    const rig = buildAvatarRig(getAbidSignatureAvatar(\\\\\\\"Ashfaq Sarker Abid\\\\\\\"), { showNameplate: false, showContactShadow: true });\\n    scene.add(rig.root);\\n\\n    const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(35, w / h, 0.1, 30);\\n    window.__abidV2 = { renderer, scene, camera, rig, animateAvatarRig, overlay };\\n\\n    // Front 3/4\\n    camera.position.set(0.55, 1.25, 3.15);\\n    camera.lookAt(0, 0.95, 0);\\n    renderer.render(scene, camera);\\n  });\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-cli/v2-front.png\\\\\\\" });\\n\\n  // Head & torso closeup\\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const { renderer, scene, camera } = window.__abidV2;\\n    camera.position.set(0.32, 1.54, 1.35);\\n    camera.lookAt(0, 1.42, 0);\\n    renderer.render(scene, camera);\\n  });\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-cli/v2-closeup.png\\\\\\\" });\\n\\n  // Peak stride walk side 3/4\\n  const walkPeak = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const { renderer, scene, camera, rig, animateAvatarRig } = window.__abidV2;\\n    rig.stridePhase = Math.PI / 2 - 0.1;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\\n      animateAvatarRig(rig, 3.8, i * 0.016, 0.016);\\n    }\\n    camera.position.set(2.1, 1.15, 2.05);\\n    camera.lookAt(0, 0.92, 0);\\n    renderer.render(scene, camera);\\n    return {\\n      leftLegX: +rig.leftLegPivot.rotation.x.toFixed(3),\\n      rightLegX: +rig.rightLegPivot.rotation.x.toFixed(3),\\n      leftArmX: +rig.leftArmPivot.rotation.x.toFixed(3),\\n      rightArmX: +rig.rightArmPivot.rotation.x.toFixed(3)\\n    };\\n  });\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\\\\\".playwright-cli/v2-walk.png\\\\\\\" });\\n\\n  // Clean up\\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const { rig, renderer, overlay } = window.__abidV2;\\n    rig.dispose();\\n    renderer.dispose();\\n    overlay.remove();\\n    delete window.__abidV2;\\n  });\\n\\n  return walkPeak;\\n}\\\"\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Re-verifying polished 3D model visuals in Playwright\", \"toolSummary\":\"Playwright re-verification\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\255\003\n\252\003\001i\024}\023\237`#\232=Y/\352\2724\207\177\213\232\265$\337\003\250\3305\b\216$\276\204\000\016\022y\246\022uR\314\327\374\004\235\362\214\216ku\245\216\253\237\025\365\241DQV\3562c\365!~_0\"v/\254\206\354+\r\215ZR\361\362l\376\024\352\371\305i\245\372\340\373\272\307\335\003\n6\236\361\277\214<_\205\350\241w\330\354/\r}q\357\331\332\372Cz&m\232\006\315\357!\3327\016\230\rp}8\351\250\211\353\363\273\310\376\243}\316\303\312\270\253\336Vz\312<\322[\353\237^82\356\245\033\347\335\177\336Fx\221:,\210D\254\221p\300+\376\373\375\257\314\265k\2340\350\350\0303h\231s\311*\252Z\367\037\365\374W\343\355\354[\032\312U\357S9\355)\371\247\304\235\220wW\361\025\305\347O\v\364\214\355\005s^\005\f\3722\232_\377\'x<\326\214\254x\206\025\361\002|I\255 \242\236\306Q\221\307\275\331Fu\244\263\372\fL\274\334X\334\203\214\357X\236\000\346h1m\035\236\3066z\373\330;R|<\243\264>\314Nbx\200,c\277(\216\001\333Et\377\n\374Z^\335\311\362K\360%\275\030\340\255\243\306\375l\204)~=\235\252@=\3028\273\226\237\n\353JfW\214\3103|q\326t\323~>Zc\313\222\244z\370\353\331\255\001\200\003\216#\327\322\277<\241o\232\fj\354}2\026\021\363\347k\351\255H\001v\033\326o\261\036\324\202\177\020\274\2350\337S\022Y\253\361K\321\221@\315\334k)c"
