    thinking: "**Analyzing the Imagery**\n\nWow, I\'m really impressed by the `v2` images, especially the seamless LatheGeometry plaid. The rich colors and zero-seam design, from the collar to the hem and sleeves, make this look so clean. I find the bare forearms add an excellent touch.\n\n\n**Refining the Facial Details**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the finer details. I\'ve been examining `v2-closeup.png` and noticed a slight bulge in the `cheekBeard` that needs refining. I propose removing it entirely and using the `jawBeardShell` to hug the oval head. I also noticed the placket\'s upper end slightly tucks behind the chest curve. I\'ll make sure it\'s fully visible. My goal is perfection.\n\n\n"
