  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Screenshot Strategy**\n\nI\'ve decided to finalize the approach for capturing the final screenshot: I\'ll grab both the front-end and a close-up image. Afterward, I\'ll remove the temporary files within the `.playwright-cli/` directory. I initially thought deleting the files in the same command would somehow prevent Playwright from displaying attached PNGs, but it\'s now clear that `playwright-cli run-code` handles returning the image files directly.\n\n\n"
