\340\246\233\340\246\276\340\247\234\340\246\276\340\246\207 \340\246\217\340\246\225 \340\246\225\340\247\215\340\246\262\340\246\277\340\246\225\340\247\207 Sign in \340\246\225\340\246\260\340\247\207 \340\246\206\340\246\252\340\246\250\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\256\340\246\277\340\246\211\340\246\234\340\246\277\340\247\237\340\246\276\340\246\256\340\247\207 \340\246\242\340\247\201\340\246\225\340\246\244\340\247\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\246\254\340\247\207**\340\245\244\n- **Gmail Permission:** \340\246\266\340\247\201\340\246\247\340\247\201 \340\246\244\340\246\226\340\246\250\340\246\207 \340\246\232\340\246\276\340\246\207\340\246\254\340\247\207 \340\246\257\340\246\226\340\246\250 \340\246\225\340\247\213\340\246\250\340\247\213 \340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\262\340\246\277\340\246\225 **Send Invitation Email** \340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\237\340\246\250\340\247\207 \340\246\225\340\247\215\340\246\262\340\246\277\340\246\225 \340\246\225\340\246\260\340\246\254\340\247\207\340\246\250\340\245\244\n\n\340\246\206\340\246\252\340\246\250\340\246\277 \340\246\232\340\246\276\340\246\207\340\246\262\340\247\207 \340\246\254\340\246\262\340\247\201\340\246\250\342\200\224\340\246\206\340\246\256\340\246\277 \340\246\217\340\246\226\340\246\250\340\246\207 \340\246\250\340\246\260\340\246\256\340\246\276\340\246\262 Google Sign-In \340\246\206\340\246\260 Gmail Send \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\246\256\340\246\277\340\246\266\340\246\250 \340\246\206\340\246\262\340\246\276\340\246\246\340\246\276 \340\246\225\340\246\260\340\247\207 \340\246\246\340\246\277\340\246\232\340\247\215\340\246\233\340\246\277, \340\246\257\340\246\276\340\246\244\340\247\207 \340\246\206\340\246\252\340\246\250\340\246\276\340\246\260 \340\246\254\340\246\250\340\247\215\340\246\247\340\247\201\340\246\260\340\246\276 \340\246\225\340\247\213\340\246\250\340\247\213 \340\246\235\340\246\276\340\246\256\340\247\207\340\246\262\340\246\276 \340\246\233\340\246\276\340\247\234\340\246\276\340\246\207 \340\246\262\340\246\227\340\246\207\340\246\250 \340\246\225\340\246\260\340\246\244\340\247\207 \340\246\252\340\246\276\340\246\260\340\247\207\340\245\244"
    thinking: "**Analyzing OAuth Verification**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the Google OAuth message. It boils down to two core issues: incomplete Google verification and the app being in a testing phase. I\'m exploring each reason to understand what\'s triggering that exact prompt.\n\n\n**Clarifying OAuth Testing Status**\n\nI\'m now focused on the \"Testing\" mode of our Google Cloud OAuth Consent Screen. I\'ve realized this restricted access is due to our use of the Gmail Send API, a \"Sensitive/Restricted OAuth scope.\" The system\'s behavior is crystal clear now: only whitelisted \"Test users\" can access the app while in Testing mode. I\'m taking a hard look at the UX details within the app to ensure smooth user flow.\n\n\n**Addressing OAuth Scope Issues**\n\nI\'ve realized the `signInWithGoogleWorkspace()` function currently requests the `gmail.send` scope at the initial sign-in, creating the OAuth prompt for every visitor, even those just browsing. I\'m focusing on that, especially invited users that just browse the museum. Deploying the AI Studio app won\'t magically solve this; the solution lies in the Google Cloud Console. I am now exploring three options: Quick invite, Verification and Sensitive scope.\n\n\n**Refining Login Flow**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on optimizing the user login flow for a better experience. I\'ve realized requesting `gmail.send` permission upfront for all users, including non-senders, is the primary source of the Google warning. I\'m focusing on the best user experience. My current plan is to split the permission request; users can login without the scope. Then, only those needing to send emails are prompted for it, preventing unnecessary warnings.\n\n\n**Separating Login & Sending**\n\nI\'m now splitting Google sign-in from Gmail sending. Now, users can sign in without the `gmail.send` scope. Once the OAuth Consent Screen is \"In Production,\" anyone can sign in without warnings. Only when sending a Gmail invite does Google ask for Gmail permission, and I\'m approved for testing. Full verification for public Gmail sending is the third option: OAuth App Verification in Google Cloud Console, requiring a privacy policy, homepage, video, and security review.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "5ocCa97fKdfX_uMPnLXh2AE"
