  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 6
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Application**: **\"My Museum\"** \342\200\224 3D virtual art museum & outdoor real-world extension built with React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Three.js, Firebase Auth + Firestore (`ai-studio-4448e632-eec0-4913-b187-f3889bfb35d4`).\n- **Core Identifiers**:\n  - Owner Email & Exclusive 3D Character Owner: `abidsarker213@gmail.com` (UID: `CwufCmYF1kOQRybSTFLoktJuo8b2`, Primary Museum ID: `museum_CwufCmYF1kOQRybSTFLoktJuo8b2`).\n  - Trusted Circle Emails: `abidsarker213@gmail.com`, `abidsarker098@gmail.com`, `suraia475@gmail.com`.\n  - Dev URL: `https://ais-dev-joduy6dwiquofhbaal2niv-406307866378.asia-northeast1.run.app`\n  - Shared URL: `https://ais-pre-joduy6dwiquofhbaal2niv-406307866378.asia-northeast1.run.app`\n- **Current User Request (Deliverables)**:\n  1. **Starting Room Exit Door to Real World**: Room 1 (`z = +9.0`) must have a working interactive door that opens directly outside into a real-world exterior.\n  2. **Lush Museum Garden & Real-World Highway**: Outside the museum \342\200\224 manicured botanical garden, fountains, flowers, tropical Bangladeshi trees (Krishnachura, Mango, Royal Palms), leading to a real-world two-way asphalt highway with **rickshaws, motorbikes, and cars**, **pedestrians walking on footpaths**, and **street lamp posts**.\n  3. **Stop & Talk / Fare Bargaining / Chintai Vehicle Takeover**: Pressing a key (`E` / `T` or clicking) stops the nearest passing rickshaw, bike, or car in front of the player to talk in Banglish, negotiate the fare (`Vara Komao` in \340\247\263 BDT) to Chittagong / Cox\'s Bazar / Local Ride, pay & ride, OR perform **\"Chintai\" (take over/seize the vehicle)** \342\200\224 ejecting the driver onto the footpath shouting while the player drives it freely (`W/S/A/D` + synchronized camera rotation, `Shift` boost, `F` to exit).\n  4. **Varied Buildings Across the Road**: Opposite side of the road (`z >= 47`) features 8 distinct architectural shapes/designs (curved glass tower, terracotta colonial arcade, stepped modernist plaza, domed cultural pavilion, A-frame caf\303\251 row, L-shaped balcony tower, hillside port tower, coastal resort villa).\n  5. **Highway Signs for Chittagong & Cox\'s Bazar**: West end (`-X`) has **`CHITTAGONG (CTG)`** road signs, highway gantry arch & green hills; East end (`+X`) has **`COX\'S BAZAR (COXS)`** road signs, coastal gantry arch, golden beach & ocean; plus immediately visible roadside directional signs near the museum exit.\n  6. **Side Minimap with Location Symbols**: Top-right live minimap showing exact player position & heading, traffic blips, and distinct symbols: **`\360\237\217\233 MUSEUM`** (inside museum), **`CTG`** (Chittagong west side), and **`COXS`** (Cox\'s Bazar east side), plus `GARDEN`/`ROAD` and live `\340\247\263` BDT wallet.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed & Tested\n- **Pure Outdoor World Logic + Unit Tests**:\n  - `/src/museum/outdoorWorld.ts`: `EXIT_DOOR_ID = \'door-exit-outside\'`, `getWorldZone` (`MUSEUM`/`GARDEN`/`ROAD`/`CTG`/`COXS`), `findNearestAnyDoor`, `clampWorldPosition` (indoor + open exit door + outdoor garden/highway/fountains/exterior museum walls), `createInitialTrafficVehicles` (7 vehicles: 3 rickshaws, 2 bikes, 2 cars), `findNearestHailVehicle`, `createTalkSession`, `changeTalkDestination`, `negotiateTalkSession`, `acceptRideFare`, `executeVehicleTakeover` (chintai), `stepVehicleDriving` (with synchronized camera yaw), `projectWorldToMinimap`.\n  - `/src/museum/outdoorWorld.test.ts`: 5 new tests.\n  - Ran full unit test suite (`npx --yes tsx --test src/museum/outdoorWorld.test.ts src/museum/cameraSteering.test.ts src/museum/trustedCircle.test.ts src/museum/layout.test.ts src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.test.ts src/services/gmailService.test.ts`) -> **30/30 passed**.\n- **Museum Exit Door Opening**:\n  - `/src/three/museumBuilder.ts`: Removed solid `southEndWall`, made `southPortal` at `z = layout.southWallZ` an interactive hinged double-leaf doorway (`doorId: EXIT_DOOR_ID`) pushed into `doors[]`, with interior signboard `\"Garden & Highway Exit \342\200\224 Press [F] or Click Door to Step Outside\"` and exterior entrance signboard.\n- **UI Components**:\n  - `/src/components/WorldMinimap.tsx`: Top-right SVG minimap with `MUSEUM` (\360\237\217\233), `CTG`, `COXS` badges, live traffic blips, rotating yellow player chevron, and `\340\247\263` BDT wallet. Already refined after R1 visual inspection so `MUSEUM` label sits cleanly above the museum box without overlapping the player arrow.\n  - `/src/components/VehicleTalkModal.tsx`: Interactive Banglish conversation, destination switcher (`Chittagong CTG` / `Cox\'s Bazar COXS` / `Local Ride`), `Bargain (Vara Komao)`, `Pay & Ride`, `Chintai (Take Vehicle)`, and `Let Go`.\n  - `/src/components/Museum3DView.tsx`: Fully wired with `buildOutdoorWorld`, indoor/outdoor sky & fog blending (`OUTDOOR_SKY_HEX = 0xc9e2f5`), `clampWorldPosition`, autonomous highway traffic with lane spacing, 9 walking footpath pedestrians + waving ejected driver NPC, `[E]`/`[T]` stop & talk, `[F]`/`[Space]` door toggle & vehicle exit, driving physics, `WorldMinimap`, and `VehicleTalkModal`. Also updated HUD throttle to `280ms` and shortened top-left placard subtitle so `Active \302\267 Standing` never truncates.\n- **Firestore Security Rules Updated, Linted & Deployed**:\n  - `/firestore.rules`: Expanded `isValidPresence` bounds from `x \342\210\210 [-50, 50], z \342\210\210 [-600, 50]` to `x \342\210\210 [-200, 200], z \342\210\210 [-600, 120]` so live multiplayer presence works outdoors all the way to Chittagong (`-108`) and Cox\'s Bazar (`+108`).\n  - Linted (`npx eslint firestore.rules` -> 0 errors) and deployed live via `rpc_action` (`service_name: \"fax\"`, `method_name: \"DeployRules\"` -> succeeded).\n\n### Partially Edited (MUST FINISH FIRST!)\n- `/src/three/outdoorBuilder.ts`:\n  - **IMPORTANT**: Just replaced the function definitions `buildCompositeTree` -> `buildInstancedTrees` and `buildStreetLampPost` -> `buildInstancedLampPosts` (around lines 250\342\200\223440) to cut outdoor draw calls ~8\303\227 via `InstancedMesh`, **BUT have NOT YET updated the two call sites further down in `buildOutdoorWorld()`** (around lines 930\342\200\2231010) that still call `buildCompositeTree(...)` and `buildStreetLampPost(...)`!\n  - Also convert the 20 flower meshes in `buildOutdoorWorld()` (around lines 870\342\200\223895) to 1 `InstancedMesh` if convenient, to further keep software WebGL snappy.\n\n### Skills Read\n- `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md` & `references/games_3d.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/threejs/SKILL.md` & `references/geometry.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **R1 Visual Inspection (`/.playwright-cli/r1-room1-start.png`)**:\n  - Room I renders crisply with `0` console errors; `Clara Moreau` stands straight & calm with `STANDING \302\267 OFFLINE` badge; `WorldMinimap` renders cleanly in top-right with `MUSEUM`, `CTG`, `COXS`, live traffic blips, and `\340\247\2631500` wallet; Exit Door prompt appears at bottom center.\n  - Confirmed synchronized left/right turn works in live browser: holding `KeyA` rotated BOTH `camYaw` (`0.000` -> `1.230`) and `playerYaw` (`3.142` -> `-1.988`).\n- **Coordinate Orientation for Stepping Outside Room 1**:\n  - Player spawns at `(x: 0, z: 4.5)` facing North (`camYaw: 0`, `yaw: PI`). The South Exit Door is directly behind the player at `(x: 0, z: 9.0)`.\n  - To walk straight out of the Exit Door from spawn in Playwright: press `KeyF` (opens `door-exit-outside`), then either hold **`KeyS`** (walk backward directly South through `z = 9.0` into the garden & highway!) OR rotate 180\302\260 (`camYaw \342\211\210 \302\2613.14`) and hold `KeyW`. Walking backward with `KeyS` (or turning to `camYaw \342\211\210 3.14` then pressing `KeyW`) goes straight down `+Z` (`4.5 -> 9.0 -> 24.5 -> 35.0`)!\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n1. **R1 Playwright Script Navigation & Screenshot Timeout**:\n   - *Symptom 1*: In R1 script, pressing `KeyA` for 2.7s rotated `camYaw` to `1.640` (facing West `-X`, not South `+Z`), so `KeyW` walked into the west wall (`x = -7.15`) instead of through the exit door at `z = 9.0`.\n   - *Symptom 2*: Later `playwright-cli screenshot` calls hit `TimeoutError: Timeout 20000ms exceeded` in SwiftShader software WebGL because ~500 unbatched outdoor meshes (25 trees \303\227 12 parts + 16 lamp posts \303\227 6 parts) were drawn every frame.\n   - *Fix (in progress)*: Batched trees into `buildInstancedTrees` (5 `InstancedMesh`es total instead of ~300 draw calls) and street lamp posts into `buildInstancedLampPosts` (3 `InstancedMesh`es instead of 96 draw calls) in `src/three/outdoorBuilder.ts`, and throttled minimap HUD updates to `280ms` in `Museum3DView.tsx`. Need to finish updating the 2 call sites in `outdoorBuilder.ts` before compiling!\n2. **Firestore Presence X/Z Coordinate Limit**:\n   - *Caught proactively*: `firestore.rules` previously limited `presence.x` to `[-50, 50]` and `presence.z` to `[-600, 50]`, which would fail when walking/driving to Chittagong (`x = -95`) or Cox\'s Bazar (`x = +95`).\n   - *Fix*: Expanded to `x \342\210\210 [-200, 200]`, `z \342\210\210 [-600, 120]`, linted with `npx eslint firestore.rules`, and deployed via `fax.DeployRules`.\n3. **Minor UI Polish Caught in R1 Screenshot (Already Fixed)**:\n   - Minimap `MUSEUM` text overlapped the yellow player marker -> moved `MUSEUM` label above the widened museum box in `WorldMinimap.tsx`.\n   - Top-left subtitle truncated `1 Active \302\267 1 Standing` -> shortened subtitle in `Museum3DView.tsx`.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- `src/three/outdoorBuilder.ts` currently will NOT compile until the call sites of `buildCompositeTree` and `buildStreetLampPost` inside `buildOutdoorWorld()` (lines ~850\342\200\2231020) are updated to call `buildInstancedTrees(...)` and `buildInstancedLampPosts(...)`.\n- Dev server still serves the pre-instancing build until we finish editing `outdoorBuilder.ts`, run `compile_applet`, and call `restart_dev_server`.\n- We are on **Verification Round 2** (final verification round for this feature, per Ultra Mode\'s max-2-round cap).\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Exact Priority Order)\n1. **Finish `src/three/outdoorBuilder.ts` Call Sites**:\n   - `view_file` lines 840\342\200\2231030 of `/src/three/outdoorBuilder.ts`.\n   - Update the tree loop (`for (const ts of treeSpecs) { ... buildCompositeTree ... }`) to a single call: `group.add(buildInstancedTrees(treeSpecs, trackGeo, trackMat, barkMat));`.\n   - Update the lamp post loop (`for (let x = -96; x <= 96; x += 24) { ... buildStreetLampPost ... }`) to collect `lampSpecs` and call `group.add(buildInstancedLampPosts(lampSpecs, trackGeo, ironMat, lampGlowMat));`.\n   - Optionally also batch the 20 garden flowers into 1 `InstancedMesh` so draw calls stay ultra-low.\n2. **Compile & Restart Dev Server**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` -> confirm build succeeds cleanly.\n   - Run `restart_dev_server` so port 3000 serves the optimized build.\n3. **Re-Run All Unit Tests**:\n   - Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/museum/outdoorWorld.test.ts src/museum/cameraSteering.test.ts src/museum/trustedCircle.test.ts src/museum/layout.test.ts src/museum/exclusiveAvatar.test.ts src/services/gmailService.test.ts` -> verify 30/30 pass.\n4. **Final Verification Round 2 in Playwright (`1440x900`, `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`, unique filenames `.playwright-cli/r2-*.png`, max 4 screenshots)**:\n   - Open `http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1`, wait 2s.\n   - Press **`KeyF`** right away (opens `door-exit-outside` in Room 1), verify `data-open-doors` contains `door-exit-outside`.\n   - Hold **`KeyS`** (walks straight South out through the open doorway into the Museum Garden & down to the highway `z ~ 29..34`), then turn `KeyA` ~1.6s so camera faces the highway/buildings/signs cleanly, verify `data-zone-symbol` is `GARDEN` or `ROAD`, capture `.playwright-cli/r2-garden-road.png`.\n   - Walk onto the highway (`z ~ 33`), wait until `vehicle-hail-prompt` appears (max 6s), press **`KeyE`** -> verify `vehicle-talk-modal` opens with Banglish quote & fare -> capture `.playwright-cli/r2-vehicle-talk.png`.\n   - Click **Bargain (Vara Komao)** -> assert `quoted-fare` drops -> click **Chintai (Take Vehicle)** -> verify `driving-banner` appears & `data-driving` is non-empty!\n   - Drive along the highway (`ShiftLeft` + `KeyW`) toward **Chittagong (`CTG`)** or **Cox\'s Bazar (`COXS`)** until `|playerX| > 55` and `data-zone-symbol` becomes `CTG` or `COXS`, capture `.playwright-cli/r2-driving-highway.png` (showing the vehicle, road, trees, varied opposite buildings, highway gantry sign, and minimap with `CTG`/`COXS` symbol!).\n   - Check `playwright-cli console` -> verify **0 errors**.\n   - Inspect all captured `.playwright-cli/r2-*.png` screenshots carefully; if any high-severity visual/functional issue appears, fix it cleanly.\n5. **Final Co-Executed Check**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together in the same response after the final code edit (and ensure unit tests ran after the last edit).\n6. **Concise Summary to User (Banglish + English)**:\n   - Clearly summarize every feature built and verified:\n     1. Starting Room (Room I) South Exit Door (`F` / `Space` / Click) opening out to the real-world Museum Garden, fountains, flowers, tropical Krishnachura/Mango/Palm trees, and footpath.\n     2. Live highway in front of the museum with Rickshaws, Motorbikes, Cars, footpath pedestrians, street lamp posts, and 8 varied building architectures across the street.\n     3. Highway signs & landmarks for **Chittagong (`CTG`)** on the West end and **Cox\'s Bazar (`COXS`)** on the East end.\n     4. Press **`E`** / **`T`** (or click any vehicle) to stop it in front of you, talk in Banglish, bargain fare (`Vara Komao`), pay & ride, or perform **Chintai** to take over & drive it (`W/S/A/D`, `Shift` boost, `F` to get off).\n     5. Live top-right **Minimap** showing your exact location with `\360\237\217\233 MUSEUM`, `CTG`, and `COXS` symbols + live traffic blips + `\340\247\263` BDT wallet.\n     6. Previous turn\'s fixes also active: automatic shared access for `abidsarker213@gmail.com`, `abidsarker098@gmail.com`, and `suraia475@gmail.com`, active vs. standing offline 3D avatars, and synchronized left/right camera + avatar rotation.\n   - Include a brief humble reminder to review the Firestore rules before sharing broadly.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Exclusive 3D Model Policy**: Only `abidsarker213@gmail.com` can control Abid\'s exclusive `abid_signature` 3D model / custom `.glb`.\n- **No `backdrop-blur` over WebGL, No Pulsating Dots**: Keep all HUD overlays solid/translucent `rgba` with clean static indicators.\n- **No Unnecessary Re-Deploy of Firestore Rules**: Rules are already updated & deployed (`x \342\210\210 [-200, 200]`, `z \342\210\210 [-600, 120]`); do not re-deploy unless `firestore.rules` changes again.\n- **Ultra Mode Honesty**: Only report tests, builds, and browser checks actually run and observed after the last edit.\n</summary>"
