  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Visual Presentation**\n\nI\'ve just made the minimap much more user-friendly on mobile devices. I\'ve switched to a compact design with responsive scaling. It now uses `w-[132px]` on mobile devices, compared to `sm:w-[216px]` on desktop. The padding has been reduced to `p-1` for mobile and expanded to `p-2` on desktops.\n\n\n**Enhancing Minimap Functionality**\n\nI\'ve added the Cross Hall indicator to the minimap, activated when the Grand Cross Hall is unlocked. I\'ve also updated the teleport mechanics to accurately handle the south walls within the Grand Cross Hall. The top-left placard is now responsive to avoid overlap with the minimap, and I am reviewing `UploadArtworkModal.tsx` to ensure there are no collisions with recent changes.\n\n\n"
