  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Hall Logic**\n\nI\'ve been reviewing the logic in `UploadArtworkModal.tsx`, specifically lines 148-182. I caught a hardcoded string and have corrected it. The aim now is to dynamically generate the correct room description, specifically displaying `(18 NEW WALLS \302\267 GRAND CROSS HALL)` when the newly created room is an X Hall, and `(8 NEW WALLS)` in other cases.\n\n\n**Testing Room Transitions**\n\nI\'m now focused on verifying room transitions and capacities. The plan is to test the transition from standard small rooms to Grand Cross Halls. I\'m writing tests for different artwork counts, ensuring correct room allocations and slot availability. I\'ll cover scenarios from 0 to 68 works and confirm that Room 3\'s 18 artwork slots are properly handled. The aim is also to clamp Cruciform collision.\n\n\n"
