  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Current Setup**\n\nI\'ve got the applet compiled, and the dev server is humming on port 3000. It\'s rendering instanced outdoor assets now, including trees, street lamps, and garden flowers via WebGL. I\'m focusing on the repetition and structure of the rooms to achieve a Grand Cross/X-Shaped Hall layout, and this is where I am currently.\n\n\n**Refining Visual States**\n\nI\'m now integrating a compact, responsive WorldMinimap for mobile and a crisp full version for desktop. Currently, I am focused on the Playwright verification script. I\'m running visual state tests on the `1440x900` desktop configuration and I am ensuring that specific events trigger correctly. For example, opening the door and walking into the highway area. I\'m capturing critical snapshots as I test the key sequences.\n\n\n**Testing Highway Interaction**\n\nI\'ve tested the fare drop after clicking \"Vara Komao\", captured the image, and triggered the \"Take Vehicle\" event. I can confirm the driving banner appears. I\'m now testing highway movement in both directions using `KeyW` and `ShiftLeft` to ensure the player progresses toward `CTG` and `COXS`.\n\n**Generating Grand Cross Hall**\n\nI\'m now generating the Grand Cross Hall in the desktop `1440x900` configuration. I\'ve seeded 18 artworks to `localStorage` and configured room data. Reloading with autostart, I\'m verifying catalog functionality by teleporting to Artwork #17 in Room 3 and then capturing a screenshot.\n\n**Confirming Mobile Minimap**\n\nI\'m checking the responsive mobile minimap layout at `390x844` on a smaller screen. I\'m verifying the `world-minimap`\'s width and ensuring it does not overlap the top-left placard. I will capture a screenshot for reference.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "WugCa6voBraW_uMPn6m_sAs"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_16070855546463290960"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"bash -c \'\\nset -euo pipefail\\ntrap \\\"playwright-cli close >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\\\" EXIT\\n\\nplaywright-cli open \\\"http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1\\\"\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid=museum-3d-view]\\\\\\\", { timeout: 15000 });\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1800);\\n\\n  // 1. Open Room 1 South Exit Door [F] and walk South (KeyS) out into the Garden & Highway\\n  const view = page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"museum-3d-view\\\\\\\");\\n  await view.click({ position: { x: 720, y: 450 } });\\n  await page.keyboard.press(\\\\\\\"KeyF\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n  const openDoors = await view.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"data-open-doors\\\\\\\");\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"OPEN_DOORS_AFTER_F:\\\\\\\", openDoors);\\n\\n  // Walk straight backward (South +Z) out through the open exit door into the garden & onto the highway!\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\\\\\"KeyS\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(4800);\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\\\\\"KeyS\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n\\n  // Rotate ~180deg so camera faces South across the highway toward buildings & signs\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\\\\\"KeyD\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1450);\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\\\\\"KeyD\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(400);\\n\\n  const zoneOut = await view.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"data-zone-symbol\\\\\\\");\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"ZONE_OUTSIDE:\\\\\\\", zoneOut);\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r2-outdoor-road.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  const view = page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"museum-3d-view\\\\\\\");\\n  // Step forward onto road edge if needed and wait for a passing vehicle hail prompt\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\\\\\"KeyW\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1200);\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\\\\\"KeyW\\\\\\\");\\n\\n  const hailBtn = page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"vehicle-hail-prompt\\\\\\\");\\n  let hailed = false;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 16; i++) {\\n    if (await hailBtn.isVisible().catch(() => false)) {\\n      hailed = true;\\n      break;\\n    }\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\\n  }\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"VEHICLE_HAILED_VISIBLE:\\\\\\\", hailed);\\n  if (hailed) {\\n    await page.keyboard.press(\\\\\\\"KeyE\\\\\\\");\\n    await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid=vehicle-talk-modal]\\\\\\\", { timeout: 6000 });\\n    const fareBefore = await page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"quoted-fare\\\\\\\").textContent();\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\", { name: /Bargain/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n    const fareAfter = await page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"quoted-fare\\\\\\\").textContent();\\n    console.log(\\\\\\\"FARE_BARGAIN:\\\\\\\", fareBefore, \\\\\\\"->\\\\\\\", fareAfter);\\n  }\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r2-vehicle-talk.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  const view = page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"museum-3d-view\\\\\\\");\\n  const talkModal = page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"vehicle-talk-modal\\\\\\\");\\n  if (await talkModal.isVisible().catch(() => false)) {\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\", { name: /Chintai/i }).click();\\n    await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid=driving-banner]\\\\\\\", { timeout: 5000 });\\n    const drivingId = await view.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"data-driving\\\\\\\");\\n    console.log(\\\\\\\"DRIVING_VEHICLE_AFTER_CHINTAI:\\\\\\\", drivingId);\\n    // Drive forward with boost along the highway\\n    await page.keyboard.down(\\\\\\\"ShiftLeft\\\\\\\");\\n    await page.keyboard.down(\\\\\\\"KeyW\\\\\\\");\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(2600);\\n    await page.keyboard.up(\\\\\\\"KeyW\\\\\\\");\\n    await page.keyboard.up(\\\\\\\"ShiftLeft\\\\\\\");\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n    console.log(\\\\\\\"ZONE_AFTER_DRIVING:\\\\\\\", await view.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"data-zone-symbol\\\\\\\"));\\n  }\\n\\n  // 2. Seed 18 artworks in guest storage -> triggers Room 1 (8) + Room 2 (8) + Room 3 GRAND CROSS HALL (18)!\\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const sampleImgs = [\\n      \\\\\\\"/assets/aistudio/placeholder.jpg\\\\\\\"\\n    ];\\n    const items = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 18; i++) {\\n      items.push({\\n        id: \\\\\\\"seed-cross-\\\\\\\" + i,\\n        museumId: \\\\\\\"guest-museum-1\\\\\\\",\\n        ownerId: \\\\\\\"guest-owner\\\\\\\",\\n        uploadedBy: \\\\\\\"guest-owner\\\\\\\",\\n        uploadedByName: \\\\\\\"Curator\\\\\\\",\\n        title: i === 16 ? \\\\\\\"Grand Cross Wing Masterpiece\\\\\\\" : \\\\\\\"Gallery Study #\\\\\\\" + (i + 1),\\n        artist: \\\\\\\"Studio Archive\\\\\\\",\\n        dateCaptured: \\\\\\\"2026-08-\\\\\\\" + String(10 + (i % 18)).padStart(2, \\\\\\\"0\\\\\\\"),\\n        notes: \\\\\\\"Archival exhibition work.\\\\\\\",\\n        imageUrl: \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\n        aspectRatio: i % 3 === 0 ? \\\\\\\"3:4\\\\\\\" : i % 3 === 1 ? \\\\\\\"1:1\\\\\\\" : \\\\\\\"4:3\\\\\\\",\\n        frameStyle: [\\\\\\\"bronze\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"walnut\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"obsidian\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"alabaster\\\\\\\"][i % 4],\\n        isOpenByCode: false,\\n        viewerEmails: []\\n      });\\n    }\\n    window.localStorage.setItem(\\\\\\\"mymuseum_guest_artworks_v2\\\\\\\", JSON.stringify(items));\\n  });\\n  await page.reload({ waitUntil: \\\\\\\"domcontentloaded\\\\\\\" });\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\\\\\"[data-testid=museum-3d-view]\\\\\\\", { timeout: 15000 });\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(1600);\\n\\n  const v2 = page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"museum-3d-view\\\\\\\");\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"CROSS_HALL_ROOMS:\\\\\\\", await v2.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"data-rooms\\\\\\\"), \\\\\\\"ARTWORKS:\\\\\\\", await v2.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"data-artworks\\\\\\\"));\\n\\n  // Open Catalog and teleport directly to Artwork #17 inside Grand Cross Hall (Room III)!\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\", { name: /Catalog/i }).click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n  await page.getByText(\\\\\\\"Grand Cross Wing Masterpiece\\\\\\\").first().click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(900);\\n  // Step slightly back/turn toward center crossing so X-mosaic floor, columns & ceiling X-ribs are visible\\n  await page.keyboard.down(\\\\\\\"KeyD\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(650);\\n  await page.keyboard.up(\\\\\\\"KeyD\\\\\\\");\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"CURRENT_ROOM_AFTER_TELEPORT:\\\\\\\", await v2.getAttribute(\\\\\\\"data-current-room\\\\\\\"));\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r2-cross-hall.png\\n\\n# 3. Mobile Viewport (390x844): verify compact responsive minimap & zero overlap!\\nplaywright-cli resize 390 844\\nplaywright-cli run-code \\\"async (page) => {\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(700);\\n  const mm = await page.getByTestId(\\\\\\\"world-minimap\\\\\\\").boundingBox();\\n  const h1 = await page.locator(\\\\\\\"h1\\\\\\\").first().boundingBox();\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"MOBILE_MINIMAP_BOX:\\\\\\\", JSON.stringify(mm));\\n  console.log(\\\\\\\"MOBILE_HEADER_BOX:\\\\\\\", JSON.stringify(h1));\\n}\\\"\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r2-mobile-minimap.png\\n\\nplaywright-cli console\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Running Playwright Round 2 verification\", \"toolSummary\":\"Run Playwright verification\"}"
